B.a8o=s(["Derin\u2192y\xfczey: Stratum basale \u2192 spinosum \u2192 granulosum \u2192 lucidum \u2192 corneum","Stratum basale: Mitoz b\xf6l\xfcnme + melanositler (UV'ye kar\u015f\u0131 melanin)","Stratum spinosum: Desmozomlar g\xfc\xe7l\xfc; Langerhans h\xfccreleri (ba\u011f\u0131\u015f\u0131kl\u0131k)","Stratum granulosum: Keratin sentezi ba\u015flar; keratohiyalin gran\xfclleri","Stratum lucidum: Yaln\u0131zca kal\u0131n deride (el ayas\u0131, ayak taban\u0131)","Stratum corneum: \xd6l\xfc, keratinli h\xfccreler; su ge\xe7irmez bariyer","Melanin: Melanositler \xfcretir, keratinositlere transfer edilir; UVB'yi emer","Keratinosit farkl\u0131la\u015fma s\xfcreci: Basale'de b\xf6l\xfcnme \u2192 Spinosum'da b\xfcy\xfcme \u2192 Granulosum'da keratinizasyon ba\u015flar \u2192 Corneum'da \xf6l\xfc h\xfccre; 2-4 hafta","Melanin tipleri: \xd6tifeomelanin (siyah/kahverengi, UV korumas\u0131 g\xfc\xe7l\xfc) + Feomelanin (sar\u0131/k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131; vitiligo'da her ikisi azal\u0131r)","Merkel h\xfccresi: Stratum basale'de; yava\u015f adaptasyonlu mekanoresept\xf6r; dokunma bilgisi CN V arac\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131yla iletilir","Stratum lucidum \xf6nemi: Sadece elde ve ayak taban\u0131nda bulunur; yo\u011fun keratin + eleidin; bu b\xf6lgeler en kal\u0131n deri","Langerhans h\xfccreleri: Kemik ili\u011fi k\xf6kenli dendritik h\xfccreler; topikal alerjende duyarl\u0131la\u015fman\u0131n ilk ad\u0131m\u0131; kontakt dermatiti arac\u0131lar"],t.s)
B.ais=new A.D("Epidermis Katmanlar\u0131",B.a8o)
B.a7Z=s(["Papiller tabaka: Gev\u015fek ba\u011f dokusu; parmak izi (dermal papillae), Meissner cisimcikleri","Retik\xfcler tabaka: Yo\u011fun d\xfczensiz ba\u011f dokusu; Ruffini ve Pacini cisimcikleri derin","Ekrin ter bezi: T\xfcm v\xfccutta; su+elektrolit+\xfcre; termoreg\xfclasyon","Apokrin ter bezi: Aksilla, kas\u0131k; ya\u011fl\u0131 salg\u0131 + bakteri \u2192 koku","Sebase bez: K\u0131l folik\xfcl\xfcne a\xe7\u0131l\u0131r; sebum (antimikrobiyal, su ge\xe7irmezlik)","T\u0131rnak: Epidermis t\xfcrevi; stratum basale proliferasyonu \u2192 t\u0131rnak b\xfcy\xfcr","K\u0131l: K\u0131l folik\xfcl\xfc + papilla (b\xfcy\xfcme) + arrector pili kas\u0131 (diken)","Dermal papillalar: Parmak izi paternidir (ki\u015fiye \xf6zg\xfc); Meissner cisimcikleri burada (hafif dokunma, 3-40 Hz); termoreg\xfclasyon i\xe7in kapillerler","Ekrin terleme kontrol\xfc: Kolinerjik sempatik (istisnai); atropin \u2192 terleme azal\u0131r; anhidroz \u2192 hipertermiye yatk\u0131nl\u0131k","Apokrin bezler aktivasyonu: Adrenerjik uyar\u0131yla + pubertede \xe7al\u0131\u015fmaya ba\u015flar; koku fermantasyonla olu\u015fur (bakteriler taraf\u0131ndan)","K\u0131l b\xfcy\xfcme d\xf6ng\xfcs\xfc: Anagen (aktif 2-7 y\u0131l) \u2192 Katagen (ge\xe7i\u015f 2-3 hafta) \u2192 Telogen (istirahat 3 ay) \u2192 Eksogen (k\u0131l d\xfc\u015fer)","Sebase bez: Holokrin salg\u0131 (h\xfccrenin kendisi par\xe7alanarak salg\u0131 olu\u015fturur); sebum antimikrobiyal + su ge\xe7irmezlik"],t.s)
B.af2=new A.D("Dermis & Deri Ekleri",B.a7Z)
B.a0x=s(["Koruma: Mekanik, kimyasal, UV, mikrobiyal bariyer","Termoreg\xfclasyon: Ter buharla\u015fmas\u0131 + dermal kan ak\u0131m\u0131","D vitamini sentezi: UVB + 7-dehidrokolesterol \u2192 D3 \u2192 karaci\u011fer \u2192 b\xf6brek \u2192 aktif D vitamini","Duyusal: Dokunma, bask\u0131, a\u011fr\u0131, s\u0131cakl\u0131k resept\xf6rleri","Ekskresyon: Ter ile \xfcre, tuz, laktik asit at\u0131l\u0131m\u0131","Ba\u011f\u0131\u015f\u0131kl\u0131k: Langerhans h\xfccreleri (dendritik h\xfccre) \u2014 antijen sunumu","D vitamini sentezi: 7-dehidrokolesterol + UVB \u2192 Previtamin D3 \u2192 cilt \u0131s\u0131s\u0131yla D3 \u2192 karaci\u011fer 25(OH)D \u2192 b\xf6brek 1,25(OH)\u2082D3 (aktif kalsitriol)","Cilt renk belirleyicileri: Melanin (UV korumas\u0131 + renk) + Oksihe-deoksihemoglobin (k\u0131zar\u0131kl\u0131k/solukluk) + Karoten (turuncu renk)","Termoreg\xfclasyon detay: Arteriyoven\xf6z anastomozlar (el/ayak u\xe7lar\u0131nda) \u2192 \u0131s\u0131 kayb\u0131 denetimi; pilor (kaz derisi) insanda i\u015flevsiz","Duysal recept\xf6r yo\u011funlu\u011fu: Parmak ucu iki nokta e\u015fi\u011fi ~2 mm; s\u0131rt ~70 mm; a\u011f\u0131z etraf\u0131 4 mm"],t.s)
B.afL=new A.D("Deri Fonksiyonlar\u0131",B.a0x)
B.a24=s(["1. derece (y\xfczeysel): Yaln\u0131zca epidermis; k\u0131zar\u0131kl\u0131k, a\u011fr\u0131; \xf6rn. g\xfcne\u015f yan\u0131\u011f\u0131; iz b\u0131rakmaz","2. derece (parsiyel kal\u0131nl\u0131k): Epidermis + dermis k\u0131sm\u0131; kabarc\u0131k; a\u011fr\u0131l\u0131; skarla iyile\u015fir","3. derece (tam kal\u0131nl\u0131k): T\xfcm deri kal\u0131nl\u0131\u011f\u0131; a\u011fr\u0131s\u0131z (sinirler tahrip); deri greft gerekir","4. derece: T\xfcm deri kal\u0131nl\u0131\u011f\u0131 + altta kas ve kemik hasar\u0131; amputasyon gerekebilir (OpenStax 2e)","Yan\u0131k alan\u0131 \u2014 9'lar kural\u0131: Ba\u015f+boyun %9, her kol %9, anterior g\xf6vde (g\xf6\u011f\xfcs+kar\u0131n) %18, posterior g\xf6vde (s\u0131rt) %18, her bacak %18, perine %1","\u0130nhalasyon yaralanmas\u0131 en \xf6l\xfcmc\xfcl komplikasyondur","2A (y\xfczeysel parsiyel kal\u0131nl\u0131k): Bazal tabaka korunmu\u015f; a\u011fr\u0131l\u0131 + \u0131slak + k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131; 14 g\xfcnde spontan iyile\u015fir; skar minimal","2B (derin parsiyel kal\u0131nl\u0131k): Derin retik\xfcler dermise uzan\u0131r; soluk + az a\u011fr\u0131l\u0131; greft gerekebilir; hipertrofik skar riski y\xfcksek","Parkland form\xfcl\xfc: 4 mL \xd7 kg \xd7 %TBSA; ilk 8 saatte %50, kalan 16 saatte %50; Ringer laktat kullan","\u0130nhalasyon hasar\u0131 belirtileri: Y\xfcz yan\u0131\u011f\u0131 + ka\u015f/kirpik yanmas\u0131 + siyah balgam + ses k\u0131s\u0131kl\u0131\u011f\u0131 + stridor \u2192 hava yolu g\xfcvencesi \xf6ncelik","Elektrik yan\u0131\u011f\u0131: Giri\u015f + \xe7\u0131k\u0131\u015f yaras\u0131; derin doku hasar\u0131 g\xf6r\xfcnenden fazla; rabdomiyoliz + kardiyak aritmi riski"],t.s)
