B.a3M=s(["Kas \u2192 Fasik\xfcl \u2192 Kas lifi (h\xfccre) \u2192 Miyofibril \u2192 Sarkomer","Sarkomer: Temel kas\u0131lma birimi; Z \xe7izgisi\u2192Z \xe7izgisi aras\u0131","A band\u0131: Miyozin (kal\u0131n) + aktin (ince) \xf6rt\xfc\u015fme b\xf6lgesi","I band\u0131: Yaln\u0131zca aktin (ince filament); kas\u0131lmada k\u0131sal\u0131r","H zonu: Yaln\u0131zca miyozin; kas\u0131lmada kaybolur","Z \xe7izgisi: Aktin filamentlerini sabitler; sarkomerin s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131","Troponin-tropomiyozin: Dinlenimde aktin-miyozin ba\u011f\u0131n\u0131 engeller","Titin proteini: Sarkomer i\xe7inde Z \xe7izgisinden M \xe7izgisine uzanan dev protein; pasif gerilim sa\u011flar; elastik \xf6zellik","T-t\xfcb\xfcl sistemi: Plazma zar\u0131n\u0131n i\xe7e uzant\u0131s\u0131; AP'yi sarkomerin merkezine iletir; diyadin/ryanodin resept\xf6r\xfc ile SR'ye ba\u011flan\u0131r","Tropomiyozin konformasyonu: Dinlenimde aktin ba\u011flama alan\u0131n\u0131 \xf6rter; Ca\xb2\u207a-troponin etkile\u015fimi ile pozisyon de\u011fi\u015fir \u2192 miyozin ba\u011flanabilir","Sarkoplazmatik retikulum: Kas h\xfccresine \xf6zg\xfc endoplazmik retikulum; Ca\xb2\u207a deposu; SERCA pompas\u0131 \u2192 Ca\xb2\u207a geri al\u0131m\u0131 (relaksasyon)","Konnektin (Titin) mutasyonu: Diyalte kardiyomiyopatiye yol a\xe7abilir; sarkomerin yap\u0131s\u0131 bozulur"],t.s)
B.ahz=new A.D("Kas Yap\u0131s\u0131",B.a3M)
B.Z2=s(["Ca\xb2\u207a sarkoplazmatik retikulumdan sal\u0131n\u0131r (aksiyon potansiyeli)","Ca\xb2\u207a + Troponin C \u2192 Tropomiyozin yana \xe7ekilir \u2192 aktin aktif alan\u0131 a\xe7\u0131l\u0131r","Miyozin ba\u015f\u0131 ADP+Pi ile y\xfckl\xfc \u2192 aktine ba\u011flan\u0131r (\xe7apraz k\xf6pr\xfc)","G\xfc\xe7 at\u0131m\u0131 (power stroke): Pi sal\u0131n\u0131r \u2192 miyozin ba\u015f\u0131 e\u011filir \u2192 aktin kayar","ATP ba\u011flan\u0131r \u2192 miyozin aktinden ayr\u0131l\u0131r \u2192 ATP hidrolizi \u2192 tekrar haz\u0131r","Rigor mortis: ATP yok \u2192 miyozin-aktin ayr\u0131lamaz \u2192 kas\u0131l\u0131 kal\u0131r","Kas\u0131lma sona erer: Ca\xb2\u207a aktif ta\u015f\u0131y\u0131c\u0131yla SR'ye geri al\u0131n\u0131r","\xc7apraz k\xf6pr\xfc d\xf6ng\xfcs\xfc: Ba\u011flanma \u2192 Power stroke (ADP+Pi sal\u0131n\u0131m\u0131; miyozin ba\u015f\u0131 ileriye e\u011filir) \u2192 ATP ba\u011flanmas\u0131 \u2192 Miyozin aktinden ayr\u0131l\u0131r \u2192 ATP hidrolizi \u2192 yeni ba\u011flanma","Kooperatif aktivasyon: Bir miyozin ba\u015f\u0131 aktine ba\u011fland\u0131\u011f\u0131nda tropomiyozin daha da yana \xe7ekilir; kom\u015fu ba\u011flanmay\u0131 kolayla\u015ft\u0131r\u0131r; e\u011fri sigmoidal","Eksitasyon-kas\u0131lma ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131: Motor sinir AP \u2192 NMK \u2192 kas AP \u2192 T-t\xfcb\xfcl \u2192 DHPR \u2192 ryanodin resept\xf6r\xfc \u2192 SR'den Ca\xb2\u207a \u2192 troponin-C","Tetanus: Frekans >80-100/dk; Ca\xb2\u207a birikimi \u2192 tam kas\u0131lma; normal kas\u0131lmadan ~4\xd7 g\xfc\xe7l\xfc; yorgunluk h\u0131zl\u0131 ba\u015flar"],t.s)
B.aiH=new A.D("Kayma Filament Teorisi",B.Z2)
B.a5N=s(["Motor \xfcnite: 1 motor n\xf6ron + innervasyonundaki t\xfcm kas lifleri","K\xfc\xe7\xfck motor \xfcnite: \u0130nce kontrol (g\xf6z, parmak); B\xfcy\xfck: Kaba g\xfc\xe7 (kuadriseps)","Tetanus: Y\xfcksek frekans uyar\u0131s\u0131 \u2192 kas\u0131lmalar toplan\u0131r \u2192 s\xfcrekli kas\u0131lma","Tonus: \u0130stirahatta k\xfc\xe7\xfck motor \xfcniteler d\xf6n\xfc\u015f\xfcml\xfc \u2192 kas\u0131n sert durmas\u0131","Tip I (yava\u015f, k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131): Yorulmaya dayan\u0131kl\u0131; mitokondri zengin; post\xfcr kaslar\u0131","Tip II (h\u0131zl\u0131, beyaz): G\xfc\xe7l\xfc-h\u0131zl\u0131 kas\u0131lma; glikolitik; kolayca yorulur","Kas hipertrofisi: Miyofibril say\u0131s\u0131 artar; hiperplazi de\u011fil","Henneman boyut prensibi: K\xfc\xe7\xfck motor \xfcniteler (Tip I, d\xfc\u015f\xfck e\u015fik) \xf6nce aktive olur; g\xfc\xe7l\xfc \xe7abada b\xfcy\xfck \xfcniteler (Tip II) eklenir","Temporal summation: Ayn\u0131 motor n\xf6ron y\xfcksek frekansta ate\u015fler \u2192 kas\u0131lmalar toplan\u0131r \u2192 unfused \u2192 fused tetanus","Spatial summation: Birden fazla motor \xfcnite ayn\u0131 anda aktive edilir \u2192 kuvvet artar; ayn\u0131 prensip n\xf6ronal iletimde de ge\xe7erli","Tip IIa (h\u0131zl\u0131 oksidatif): Orta g\xfc\xe7 + iyi dayan\u0131kl\u0131l\u0131k; mitokondri + glikojen var; ara profil; sprinterlerde daha fazla"],t.s)
B.afa=new A.D("Motor \xdcnite & Kas\u0131lma Tipleri",B.a5N)
B.a5t=s(["Deltoid: Kol abd\xfcksiyonu (CN XI aksiller n.)","Biceps brachii: Fleksiyon + supinasyon; MSS'te C5-C6","Triceps brachii: Ekstansiyon; radyal sinir (C7)","Pectoralis major: Add\xfcksiyon + i\xe7 rotasyon","Latissimus dorsi: Add\xfcksiyon + ekstansiyon + i\xe7 rotasyon","Kuadriseps (4 kas): Diz ekstansiyonu; femoral sinir","Hamstringler: Diz fleksiyonu; siyatik sinir","Gastroknemiyal: Plantarfleksiyon; tibial sinir (S1-S2)","Diyafram: Inspirasyonun ana kas\u0131; frenik sinir (C3-C5)","Rotator man\u015fet kaslar\u0131: Supraspinatus (0-15\xb0 abd\xfcksiyon ba\u015flat\u0131r) + \u0130nfraspinatus (d\u0131\u015f rotasyon) + Teres minor (d\u0131\u015f rotasyon) + Subscapularis (i\xe7 rotasyon)","Serratus anterior: Skapulay\u0131 g\xf6\u011f\xfcs duvar\u0131na sabitler; uzun torasik sinir (C5-C7); hasar\u0131 \u2192 'winged scapula'","Tibialis anterior: Dorsifleksiyonu + inversiyonu; derin peroneal sinir (L4); peroneal sinir hasar\u0131 \u2192 ayak d\xfc\u015fmesi (footdrop)","Gluteus medius: Y\xfcr\xfcy\xfc\u015fte pelvik stabilizasyon; trendelenburg y\xfcr\xfcy\xfc\u015f\xfc \u2192 zay\u0131fl\u0131k; superior gluteal sinir","Erekt\xf6r spina: \u0130liokostalis + Longissimus + Spinalis; omurga ekstansiyonu; bel a\u011fr\u0131s\u0131n\u0131n en s\u0131k kayna\u011f\u0131"],t.s)
B.agI=new A.D("B\xfcy\xfck Kas Gruplar\u0131",B.a5t)
B.a55=s(["\u0130lk ~15 sn: Fosfajen (ATP + kreatin fosfat) \u2014 patlay\u0131c\u0131 g\xfc\xe7; kreatin kinaz kataliz\xf6r","~15 sn \u2013 1 dk: Anaerobik glikoliz \u2192 laktat + H\u207a birikimi; h\u0131zl\u0131 ama k\u0131sa s\xfcreli","1 dk \xfczeri: Aerobik metabolizma (glikoz + ya\u011f + O\u2082); s\xfcrekli egzersiz; kaslar\u0131n %95 ATP'si dinlenimdeyken aerobik","Oksijen borcu: Egzersiz sonras\u0131 y\xfcksek O\u2082 t\xfcketimi; laktat\u0131 glikoza \xe7evirmek i\xe7in","Laktik asit yorgunlu\u011fu: pH d\xfc\u015fer \u2192 enzim aktivitesi azal\u0131r","Miyoglobin: Kas i\xe7i O\u2082 deposu; k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131 kas renginden sorumlu","Fosfajen sistemi dolumu: Kreatin fosfat 3-5 dakikada yenilenir; dinlenme aral\u0131\u011f\u0131 bu y\xfczden spor antrenman\u0131nda \xf6nemli","EPOC (egzersiz sonras\u0131 oksijen borcu): Laktat \u2192 karaci\u011ferde glukoneogenez (Cori d\xf6ng\xfcs\xfc) + miyoglobin O\u2082 yenileme + v\xfccut \u0131s\u0131s\u0131","Rabdomiyoliz: A\u015f\u0131r\u0131 egzersiz + travma + statinler + alkol \u2192 kas y\u0131k\u0131m\u0131 \u2192 miyoglobin\xfcri \u2192 AKI; CK >10.000 U/L; IV s\u0131v\u0131 ivedi","Tip I lif antrenman\u0131: Dayan\u0131kl\u0131l\u0131k egzersizi \u2192 mitokondri say\u0131s\u0131 + kapiller yo\u011funluk + miyoglobin artar; Tip II d\xf6n\xfc\u015f\xfcm\xfc yok","Miyozin a\u011f\u0131r zincir izoformleri: Tip I (MHC-I, yava\u015f ATPaz), Tip IIa (MHC-IIa), Tip IIx (MHC-IIx, h\u0131zl\u0131 ATPaz); antrenmanla de\u011fi\u015febilir"],t.s)
