B.XM=s(["\u0130stirahat membran potansiyeli: \u221270 mV (Na\u207a d\u0131\u015far\u0131da, K\u207a i\xe7eride)","Depolarizasyon: Na\u207a kap\u0131lar\u0131 a\xe7\u0131l\u0131r \u2192 i\xe7eri akar \u2192 +30 mV","Repolarizasyon: K\u207a kap\u0131lar\u0131 a\xe7\u0131l\u0131r \u2192 d\u0131\u015far\u0131 akar \u2192 dinlenim potansiyeline d\xf6ner","Hiperpolarizasyon: K\u207a kanallar\u0131 ge\xe7 kapan\u0131r \u2192 \u221280 mV'e d\xfc\u015fer","Refrakter d\xf6nem: Mutlak (AP imk\xe2ns\u0131z) + R\xf6latif (e\u015fik y\xfcksek)","Hepsi-ya-hi\xe7bir-\u015fey yasas\u0131: E\u015fi\u011fe ula\u015f\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda AP b\xfcy\xfckl\xfc\u011f\xfc sabittir","\u0130letim h\u0131z\u0131: Miyelin kal\u0131nl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve akson \xe7ap\u0131 \u2191 \u2192 h\u0131z \u2191","Dinlenme potansiyeli olu\u015fumu: K\u207a d\u0131\u015far\u0131 s\u0131zmas\u0131 (GK \xe7ok y\xfcksek) + Na\u207a/K\u207a ATPaz (3 Na\u207a d\u0131\u015far\u0131 / 2 K\u207a i\xe7eri) \u2192 i\xe7 negatif","E\u015fik potansiyeli: ~-55 mV; bu noktada hepsi-ya-hi\xe7bir-\u015fey tetiklenir; e\u015fik alt\u0131 uyar\u0131lar temporal/spatial summation ile toplanabilir","Na\u207a kanal\u0131 inaktivasyonu: Depolarizasyon sonras\u0131 kap\u0131 kapan\u0131r (h kap\u0131s\u0131); mutlak refrakter d\xf6nem bu y\xfczden; kanallar kendili\u011finden a\xe7\u0131l\u0131r ~1-2 ms","Hiperpolarizasyonun \xf6nemi: K\u207a ge\xe7 kapanmas\u0131; e\u015fi\u011fi ge\xe7ici y\xfckseltir \u2192 g\xf6reli refrakter d\xf6nem; AP frekans\u0131n\u0131 s\u0131n\u0131rlar","Akson terminal boyu: Uzun aksonlar (>1 metre, diyabetik n\xf6ropati en uzundan ba\u015flar) + k\u0131sa (beyin i\xe7i intern\xf6ron ~\xb5m)"],t.s)
