B.a_s=s(["Kimyasal sinaps: Presinaptik \u2192 Ca\xb2\u207a \u2192 vezik\xfcl f\xfczyonu \u2192 NT sal\u0131n\u0131m\u0131 \u2192 postsinaptik resept\xf6r","Asetilkolin (ACh): Motor sinir-kas, parasempatik, SSS \xe7o\u011fu sinaps","Norepinefrin: Sempatik postgangliyonik, beyin n\xf6romod\xfclasyonu","Dopamin: \xd6d\xfcl, motor kontrol (bazal ganglia); Parkinson'da eksik","Serotonin: Ruh hali, i\u015ftah, uyku; SSRI ile art\u0131r\u0131l\u0131r (depresyon)","GABA: Ba\u015fl\u0131ca inhibit\xf6r NT; benzodiyazepin GABA-A resept\xf6r\xfcn\xfc g\xfc\xe7lendirir","Glutamat: Ba\u015fl\u0131ca eksitat\xf6r NT; NMDA resept\xf6r\xfc \xf6\u011frenme-bellek","ACh sentezi: Kolin + Asetil-CoA \u2192 kolin asetiltransferaz (ChAT) \u2192 ACh; kolin yeniden al\u0131m\u0131 i\xe7in HACU transporteri","ACh y\u0131k\u0131m\u0131: Asetilkolinesteraz sinapsta \u2192 kolin + asetat; organofosforlar bu enzimi bloke \u2192 paralizi; neostigmin antidot (NMK'da)","Vesik\xfcl d\xf6ng\xfcs\xfc: Exositoz \u2192 membrana f\xfczyon \u2192 endositoz \u2192 yeniden doldurma; SNARE kompleksi (VAMP + SNAP-25 + sintaksin) f\xfczyonu sa\u011flar","Dopamin yolaklar\u0131: Mezolimbik (\xf6d\xfcl, ba\u011f\u0131ml\u0131l\u0131k) + Mezokortikal (BPK/bili\u015fsel) + Nigrostriatal (motor, Parkinson) + T\xfcberoinfundibuler (prolaktin bask\u0131)","Glutamat eksitotoksisite: A\u015f\u0131r\u0131 NMDA aktivasyonu \u2192 Ca\xb2\u207a a\u015f\u0131r\u0131 giri\u015fi \u2192 mitokondri hasar\u0131 \u2192 n\xf6ron \xf6l\xfcm\xfc; \u0130nmede kritik \u2192 NMDA antagonisti ara\u015ft\u0131r\u0131l\u0131yor","Endojen opioidler: \u03b2-endorfin (hipofiz, stres) + Enkefalin (lokal a\u011fr\u0131 mod\xfclasyon) + Dinorfin (\u03ba resept\xf6r\xfc, disfori); opioid kriz yararl\u0131"],t.s)
