B.a7A=s(["CN I (Olfakt\xf6r): Koku \u2014 duyusal","CN II (Optik): G\xf6rme \u2014 duyusal","CN III (Ok\xfclomotor): G\xf6z hareketi (4 kas), g\xf6z kapa\u011f\u0131, pupil k\xfc\xe7\xfcltme","CN IV (Troklear): Superior oblik kas (a\u015fa\u011f\u0131-i\xe7e bak\u0131\u015f)","CN V (Trigeminal): Y\xfcz duyusu (3 dal) + \xe7i\u011fneme kaslar\u0131","CN VI (Abdusens): Lateral rektus \u2192 d\u0131\u015fa bak\u0131\u015f","CN VII (Fasiyal): Mimik kaslar\u0131 + \xf6n 2/3 dil tad\u0131 + lakrimal/t\xfck\xfcr\xfck","CN VIII (Vestib\xfclok\xf6lear): \u0130\u015fitme + denge","CN IX (Glossofaringeal): Arka 1/3 dil tad\u0131/duyu + parotis bezi","CN X (Vagus): Parasempatik (kalp, akci\u011fer, G\u0130S) + yutma + ses","CN XI (Aksesuar): Trapezius + sternokleidomastoid","CN XII (Hipoglossal): Dil hareketleri (konu\u015fma, yutma)","CN III lezyonu bulgular\u0131: Komplet ptoz + mydriasis (dilate + \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011fa yan\u0131ts\u0131z) + 'down and out' pozisyon; posterior kommunikan anevrizma bask\u0131s\u0131","CN VII periferik vs santral: Bell's palsy \u2192 t\xfcm y\xfcz ipsilateral; \u0130nme (santral) \u2192 al\u0131n korunur (bilateral kortikal temsil), kontralateral alt y\xfcz","CN V \u2014 Trigeminal nevralji: Elektrik \u015foku tarz\u0131 a\u011fr\u0131; tetik nokta; 2. \xe7\xfcr\xfck di\u015f san\u0131l\u0131r; karbamazepin 1. se\xe7enek; MVD cerrahi","CN VIII Akustik n\xf6roma: CPA k\xf6\u015fesi; unilateral SNHL + tinnitus + denge bozuklu\u011fu; gadolinyumlu MRI; y\xfcz siniri (CN VII) bask\u0131s\u0131 riski","Horner sendromu: Ptozis + Miyozis + Anhidroz; sempatik yol kesimi; akci\u011fer apeks t\xfcm\xf6r\xfc (Pancoast) + karotid diseksiyonu + lateral med\xfcller infarkt","Marcus Gunn pupillas\u0131: Afferent pupiller defekt (RAPD); etkilenen g\xf6zde \u0131\u015f\u0131k tutulunca her iki g\xf6z geni\u015fler; CN II (optik) lezyonu veya optik n\xf6rit (MS)"],t.s)
