B.ZN=s(['Sempatik: "Fight or flight"; torakolumbar (T1\u2013L2); pregangliyonik k\u0131sa, postgangliyonik uzun','Parasempatik: "Rest and digest"; kraniosakral (CN III, VII, IX, X + S2-4); pregangliyonik uzun, postgangliyonik k\u0131sa',"Pregangliyonik NT: Her ikisinde de ACh (nikotinik resept\xf6r)","Sempatik postgangliyonik NT: Norepinefrin (adrenerjik) \u2014 istisna: ekrin ter bezleri (ACh)","Parasempatik postgangliyonik NT: ACh (muskarinik resept\xf6r)","Adrenal med\xfclla: Sempatik pregangliyonik \u2192 epinefrin+NE do\u011frudan kana","Sempatik pregangliyonik: T1-L2 lateral boynuz; paravertebral (zincir gangliyon, hemen etkili) veya prevertebral (\xe7\xf6liyak, mesenterik, ge\xe7)","Parasempatik kranyal: CN III \u2192 siliyer ganglion (pupil); CN VII \u2192 pterigopalatin (g\xf6zya\u015f\u0131/burun) + submandib\xfcler; CN IX \u2192 otik; CN X \u2192 organik terminal","Enterik sinir sistemi: ~100 milyon n\xf6ron; subm\xfck\xf6z (Meissner) + miyenterik (Auerbach) pleksus; SSS'den ba\u011f\u0131ms\u0131z ba\u011f\u0131rsak motilitesi","Otonomik disrefleksi: Y\xfcksek omurilik kesisi (T6 \xfczeri) + uyar\u0131 (mesane/ba\u011f\u0131rsak dolu) \u2192 kontrols\xfcz sempatik \u2192 hipertansif kriz; ba\u015fa\u011fr\u0131s\u0131 + terleme"],t.s)
