B.a95=s(["Kalp: HR \u2191, kontraktilite \u2191 (\u03b21)","Damarlar: Vazokonstr\xfcksiyon (\u03b11) \u2192 kan bas\u0131nc\u0131 \u2191","Akci\u011fer: Bronkodilatasyon (\u03b22)","G\u0130S: Motilite ve salg\u0131 \u2193; sfinkterler kas\u0131l\u0131r","G\xf6z: Midriyazis (geni\u015fleme); siliyer kas gev\u015fer \u2192 uza\u011fa odak","Karaci\u011fer: Glikojenoliz + glukoneogenez \u2192 kan glukozu \u2191","B\xf6brek: Renin sal\u0131n\u0131m\u0131 (\u03b21) \u2192 RAAS aktivasyonu","\u03b21 etkiler: HR \u2191 + kontraktilite \u2191 + renin \u2191; \u03b21 blokaj \u2192 KY + MI + HT tedavisi (metoprolol, bisoprolol, karvedilol)","\u03b11 etkiler: Damar \u2192 vazokonstr\xfcksiyon; g\xf6z \u2192 midriyazis; mesane \u2192 sfinkter kas\u0131lmas\u0131 (idrar tutma); uterus \u2192 kas\u0131lma","\u03b12 presinaptik: NE'nin kendi salg\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 inhibe eder; klonidin \u03b12 agonisti \u2192 sempatik ton \u2193 \u2192 kan bas\u0131nc\u0131 \u2193; opioiddeki \xe7ekilmede de kullan\u0131l\u0131r","S\xfcrrenal kriz: Stres an\u0131nda sempatoadrenal aks aktive; epinefrin (%80) + NE (%20) \u2192 kana; t\xfcm v\xfccudun haz\u0131rlanmas\u0131","\u03b22 agonistler (salbutamol): Bronkodilatasyon + uterus relaksasyonu + karaci\u011fer glikogenolizis; inhale \u2192 sistemik etkisi minimum"],t.s)
