B.aaw=s(["Plazma (%55): Su %91 + protein (alb\xfcmin, glob\xfclin, fibrinojen) + elektrolitler","\u015eekilli elemanlar (%45): Eritrosit, l\xf6kosit, trombosit","Hematokrit: Kanda eritrosit y\xfczdesi; E normal %42-52, K %37-47","Alb\xfcmin: En bol plazma proteini; onkotik bas\u0131n\xe7 + ta\u015f\u0131y\u0131c\u0131","Serum: Fibrinojen ve p\u0131ht\u0131la\u015fma fakt\xf6rlerinin uzakla\u015ft\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131 plazma","Plazma vs serum: Plazma = t\xfcm p\u0131ht\u0131la\u015fma fakt\xf6rleri dahil; Serum = fibrinojen ve p\u0131ht\u0131la\u015fma fakt\xf6rleri \xe7\u0131kar\u0131ld\u0131ktan sonra kalan","Kolloidal ozmotik bas\u0131n\xe7: Alb\xfcmin b\xfcy\xfck \xf6l\xe7\xfcde; 25 mmHg; kapillerde s\u0131v\u0131y\u0131 \xe7eker; d\xfc\u015ferse \u2192 \xf6dem (siroz, nefrotik sendrom)","Fibrinojen: Akut faz reaktan\u0131 (enfeksiyonda artar); trombine d\xf6n\xfc\u015ferek fibrin olu\u015fturur; y\xfcksek = kardiyovask\xfcler risk","\u0130mm\xfcnoglobulinler: Gama globulin fraksiyonunda; SPEP'te M spike \u2192 myelom; hipogamaglobulinemi \u2192 tekrarlayan enfeksiyon"],t.s)
B.agE=new A.D("Kan Bile\u015fenleri",B.aaw)
B.aau=s(["Bikonkav disk, \xe7ekirdeksiz, 120 g\xfcn \xf6m\xfcr; dalakta y\u0131k\u0131l\u0131r","Hemoglobin: 4 zincir + 4 hem grubu; her hem 1 O\u2082 ba\u011flar","EPO: B\xf6brekten; hipokside \u2191 \u2192 kemik ili\u011finde eritropoez \u2191","Demir eksikli\u011fi anemisi: MCH\u2193, MCV\u2193 (mikrositik hipokromik)","B12/folat eksikli\u011fi: MCV\u2191 (makrositik megaloblastik)","Orak h\xfccre anemisi: HbS \u2014 deoksijenasyon \u2192 polimerizasyon \u2192 a\u011fr\u0131 krizi; sitrat ile hemoliz korumas\u0131","G6PD eksikli\u011fi: X'e ba\u011fl\u0131; oksidatif stres (primakin, bakla) \u2192 hemoliz","2,3-DPG: Eritrositlerde glikoliz yan \xfcr\xfcn\xfc; Hb'ye ba\u011flanarak oksijen afinitesin \u2193 \u2192 doku oksijeni \u2191; y\xfcksek irtifada 2,3-DPG artar","Hb-O\u2082 disosiasyon e\u011frisi sola kayma: pH \u2191, PCO\u2082 \u2193, T \u2193, 2,3-DPG \u2193 \u2192 afinite \u2191 \u2192 dokuya O\u2082 sal\u0131m\u0131 \u2193 (fetal Hb F sola kayar)","Demir emilimi: Duodenum + proksimal jejunum; Fe\xb2\u207a (ferr\xf6z) form emilir; C vitamini (askorbik asit) Fe\xb3\u207a \u2192 Fe\xb2\u207a d\xf6n\xfc\u015f\xfcm\xfcn\xfc art\u0131r\u0131r","Eritropoetin: Hipoksiye duyarl\u0131 b\xf6brek perit\xfcb\xfcler h\xfccreleri HIF-1\u03b1 \u2192 EPO geni; KBH'de fibroz \u2192 EPO \u2193 \u2192 anemi; darbepoietin alfa renal anemi tedavisi","Polisitemia vera: JAK2 V617F mutasyonu; EPO ba\u011f\u0131ms\u0131z eritropoez; hiperviskozite \u2192 tromboz; ruya/ka\u015f\u0131nt\u0131 (Aquagenik pruritis) karakteristik"],t.s)
B.agW=new A.D("Eritrositler",B.aau)
B.a6w=s(["Gran\xfclositler: N\xf6trofil (%50-70), Eozinofil (%2-4), Bazofil (%0.5-1)","Agran\xfclositler: Monosit (%3-8), Lenfosit (%20-30)",'N\xf6trofil: \u0130lk yan\u0131t; bakteriyofaj, mantar; \xe7ubuk \u015fekli "sol kaymas\u0131" (enfeksiyonda)',"Eozinofil: Parazit m\xfccadelesi, alerjik reaksiyon (IgE ile)","Bazofil: Histamin + heparin; mast h\xfccresiyle benzer rol (alerjide)","Monosit \u2192 Makrofaj: Fagositoz + antijen sunumu + sitokin \xfcretimi","T lenfosit: H\xfccre arac\u0131l\u0131 ba\u011f\u0131\u015f\u0131kl\u0131k; B lenfosit: Antikor \xfcretimi","N\xf6trofil i\u015flevleri: Kemotaksis (IL-8 \xe7ekici) \u2192 Aderans (integrin-ICAM) \u2192 Fagositoz \u2192 Oksidatif patlama (NADPH oksidaz \u2192 O\u2082\u207b \u2192 H\u2082O\u2082 \u2192 MPO \u2192 HOCl) \u2192 Degran\xfclasyon","Kronik gran\xfclomat\xf6z hastal\u0131k: NADPH oksidaz eksikli\u011fi \u2192 katalsaz (+) bakterilere (Staph, Aspergillus) kar\u015f\u0131 yetersiz \xf6ld\xfcrme; NBT testi negatif; a\u011f\u0131r tekrarlayan enfeksiyon","Chediak-Higashi: Lizosomal trafficking bozuklu\u011fu; dev gran\xfcller n\xf6trofil/NK/sitotoksik T'de; albinizm + enfeksiyon + hemofagositik","Eozinofil gran\xfcller: MBP (major basic protein) + ECP (eosinophil cationic protein) + eotaksin; helmint \xf6ld\xfcrme; IgE ile mast h\xfccresi zaten uyarm\u0131\u015f","Lenfosit alt tipleri: CD4 (helper), CD8 (sitotoksik), Treg (CD4+CD25+FoxP3), NK (CD16+CD56); B h\xfccresi (CD19+CD20) plazma h\xfccresine farkl\u0131la\u015f\u0131r"],t.s)
B.afs=new A.D("L\xf6kositler",B.a6w)
B.aal=s(["ABO: A antijeni \u2192 Ani-B antikoru; B antijeni \u2192 Anti-A antikoru","AB: Her iki antijen var, antikor yok \u2192 evrensel al\u0131c\u0131","O: Antijen yok, her iki antikor var \u2192 evrensel verici (O-)","Rh sistemi: Rh+ = D antijeni var; Rh- = D antijeni yok","Rh uyumsuzlu\u011fu: Rh- anne, Rh+ bebek \u2192 eritroblastozis fetalis (2. gebelikte)","Anti-D imm\xfcnoglob\xfclin (RhoGAM): 28. haftada ve do\u011fumda Rh- anneye verilir","H antijeni: ABO sisteminin \xf6nc\xfcs\xfc; tip O'da H antijeni bol; Bombay (hh) fenotipinde H de yok \u2192 hi\xe7bir ABO grubundan kan alamaz","ABO ekspresyonu: Eritrosit + trombosit + endotel + epitel y\xfczeylerinde; organ transplantasyonunda da ABO uyumu \u015fart","Rh antikorlar\u0131: Anti-D IgG; plasentay\u0131 ge\xe7er \u2192 fetal hemoliz; IgM anti-A/B plasentay\u0131 ge\xe7mez \u2192 ABO uyumsuzlu\u011fu daha az ciddi","Kan grubu testleri: Forward typing (h\xfccreye antiserum ekle) + Reverse typing (seruma bilinen h\xfccreler ekle); uyumsuzlukta \u2192 agglutination","Transf\xfczyon reaksiyonu: Akut hemolitik (ABO uyumsuzluk \u2014 ya\u015fam\u0131 tehdit) + Gecikmeli hemolitik (Rh/min\xf6r \u2014 3-14 g\xfcn) + Febril (antil\xf6kosit Ab) + TRALI (antin\xf6trofil Ab \u2192 akci\u011fer)"],t.s)
B.ahL=new A.D("Kan Gruplar\u0131",B.aal)
B.aan=s(["1. Damar spazm\u0131: Endotelin, serotonin \u2192 vazokonstr\xfcksiyon","2. Trombosit t\u0131kac\u0131: GPIb \u2192 vWF \u2192 trombosit yap\u0131\u015fmas\u0131; ADP+TXA2 \u2192 agregasyon","3. Koag\xfclasyon: Fibrinojen \u2192 Fibrin (fakt\xf6r XIII \xe7apraz ba\u011flar)","D\u0131\u015f yol: Doku fakt\xf6r\xfc (TF) + VII \u2192 Xa; INR ile izlenir (warfarin etkisi)","\u0130\xe7 yol: XII \u2192 XI \u2192 IX \u2192 Xa; aPTT ile izlenir (heparin etkisi)","Ortak yol: Xa + Va \u2192 Protrombin \u2192 Trombin \u2192 Fibrinojen \u2192 Fibrin","Hemofili A: Fakt\xf6r VIII eksikli\u011fi (X'e ba\u011fl\u0131); Hemofili B: Fakt\xf6r IX (X'e ba\u011fl\u0131)","vWF eksikli\u011fi: vWD \u2192 trombosit adhesyon bozuklu\u011fu \u2192 muk\xf6z kanama","Trombosit aktivasyon: GPIb + vWF \u2192 adezyon \u2192 ADP + TXA2 (trombosit aktivasyon sinyali) + PAF \u2192 GPIIb/IIIa ekspresyonu \u2192 fibrinojen ba\u011flanmas\u0131 \u2192 agregasyon","Protein C/S sistemi: Trombin + trombomodulin \u2192 Protein C aktive; Protein S kofakt\xf6r; Fakt\xf6r Va + VIIIa inaktive; do\u011fal antikoag\xfclan","Antitrombin III: Fakt\xf6r IIa (trombin) + Xa + IXa inaktive; heparin ATIII aktivitesini \xd71000 art\u0131r\u0131r; ATIII eksikli\u011finde heparin etkisiz","Fibrinoliz: Plazminojen \u2192 tPA \u2192 Plazmin \u2192 Fibrin y\u0131k\u0131m\u0131 \u2192 D-dimer + FDP; tPA inme tedavisinde; tPA inhibit\xf6r\xfc \u2192 traneksamik asit (antifibrinolitik)","DIC laboratuvar: PT \u2191 + aPTT \u2191 + fibrinojen \u2193 + D-dimer \u2191 + trombosit \u2193 + periferik yaymada schistosit (fragmentasyon hemolizi)"],t.s)
B.af4=new A.D("Hemostaz & P\u0131ht\u0131la\u015fma",B.aan)
