B.a5c=s(["NSA\u0130\u0130: COX inhibit\xf6r\xfc \u2192 PG sentezi \u2193; yan etki: Gastrit (misoprostol ile korunma), b\xf6brek hasar\u0131, platelet fonk. bozuklu\u011fu","Aspirin: Geri d\xf6n\xfc\u015f\xfcms\xfcz COX inhibit\xf6r\xfc; trombosit \xf6mr\xfc (10 g\xfcn) boyunca etkili; Reye sendromu (\xe7ocukta)","Parasetamol: Santral etki; COX-3?; KCFT bozuklu\u011fu yok (terap\xf6tik dozda); OD \u2192 karaci\u011fer nekrozu (N-asetilsistein antidot)","Opioid: \u03bc resept\xf6r\xfc \u2192 analjezi+sedasyon+obstipasyon+solunum depresyonu; Nalokson: antagonist","Morfin: Biliyer kolik yerine (sfinkter Oddi spazm\u0131 yapar); renal kolikte g\xfcvenli","NSA\u0130\u0130 mekanizma: COX-1 (trombosit, mide mukoza) + COX-2 (inflamasyon, a\u011fr\u0131, febris) inhibit\xf6r\xfc; COX-2 se\xe7ici (selekoksib) \u2192 gastrik koruma ama kardiyak risk","Aspirin doz farkl\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131: D\xfc\u015f\xfck doz (75-100 mg) \u2192 irreversibl COX-1 \u2192 antiplatelet; y\xfcksek doz (>650 mg) \u2192 COX-1+2 \u2192 analjezi/antipiretik; Reye sendromu \xe7ocukta viral hastal\u0131kta","Parasetamol toksisite mekanizmas\u0131: NAPQI metaboliti (CYP2E1) \u2192 glutatyon t\xfckenir \u2192 hepatosit hasar\u0131; N-asetilsistein \u2192 glutatyon yenileme; erken (<8 saat) antidot kritik","Opioid resept\xf6r tipleri: \u03bc (analjezi + solunum depresyonu + konstipasyon + \xf6tori) + \u03ba (disfori + sedatyon) + \u03b4 (analjezi + duygudurum); partial agonist: buprenorfin (\u03bc k\u0131smi agonist)","Analjezi merdiveni (WHO): 1. basamak (NSA\u0130\u0130 + parasetamol) \u2192 2. basamak (zay\u0131f opioid: tramadol) \u2192 3. basamak (g\xfc\xe7l\xfc opioid: morfin, oksikodon); adjuvanlar her basamakta"],t.s)
