B.Zp=s(["Beta-laktam: Penisilin/Sefalosporin/Karbapenem \u2192 PBP'ye ba\u011flan\u0131r \u2192 h\xfccre duvar\u0131 sentezi bozulur","Aminoglikozit: Gentamisin, Tobramisin \u2192 30S ribosom; nefrotoksik + ototoksik","Makrolid: Eritromisin, Azitromisin \u2192 50S ribosom; atipik pn\xf6moni","Florokinolon: Siprofloksasin \u2192 DNA giraz (topoizomeraz II); Gram (-) g\xfc\xe7l\xfc","Metronidazol: Anaeroblar + protozoa (Giardia, Trichomonas); alkol ile dis\xfclfiram reaksiyonu",'Vankomisin: MRSA; glikopeptid \u2192 h\xfccre duvar\u0131; "Red man sendromu" \u2192 yava\u015f inf\xfcze et',"Rifampisin: TB + meningokoko profilaksi; CYP inducer \u2192 OCP etkisini azalt\u0131r","Penisilinaz direnci: Kloksasilin + dikloksasilin + nafsilin + oksasilin; stafilokokal enfeksiyonlar (MRSA hari\xe7); 'anti-stafilokokal penisilinler'","Sefalosporin jenerasyonlar\u0131: 1. ku\u015fak (gram (+) g\xfc\xe7l\xfc: sefazolin) \u2192 2. ku\u015fak (H. influenzae: sefuroksim) \u2192 3. ku\u015fak (gram (-) g\xfc\xe7l\xfc: seftriakson) \u2192 4. ku\u015fak (Pseudomonas: sefepim) \u2192 5. (MRSA: seftarolin)","Tetrasiklinler: 30S ribosom; protein sentezi inhibe; geni\u015f spektrum; doksisiklin (atipik pn\xf6moni, Lyme, Rickettsia, Brucella); kalsiyum/antasit emilimi \u2193; di\u015f sar\u0131la\u015fmas\u0131 (<8 ya\u015f KI)","Linezolid: Oksazolidinon; 23S rRNA 50S; MRSA + VRE; MAO inhibit\xf6r\xfc \u2192 hipertansif kriz riski; serotonin sendromu; trombositopeni uzun kullan\u0131mda","Kloramfenikol: 50S; aplastik anemi (idiyosinkratik) + gri bebek sendromu (yetersiz hepatik glukuronidaz); s\u0131n\u0131rl\u0131 endikasyon; tifo/beyin apsesinde kullan\u0131l\u0131r"],t.s)
