B.a1A=s(["\u03b2-bloker (metoprolol, karvedilol): HR \u2193, kontraktilite \u2193; MI+KY+HT; ast\u0131mda K\u0130","ACE inhibit\xf6r\xfc (ramipril, enalapril): Anjiotensin II\u2193 \u2192 vazodilasyon + aldosteron \u2193; \xf6ks\xfcr\xfck yan etki; gebelikte K\u0130","ARB (losartan): ACE benzeri etki; AT1 blokaj\u0131; \xf6ks\xfcr\xfck yok; gebelikte K\u0130","Statin (atorvastatin): HMG-CoA red\xfcktaz inhibit\xf6r\xfc \u2192 LDL \u2193; miyopati yan etki","Digoksin: Na/K ATPaz inhibit\xf6r\xfc \u2192 intrasell\xfcler Ca\xb2\u207a\u2191 \u2192 inotropi \u2191; AV ileti \u2193; dar terap\xf6tik pencere","Amiodaron: \xc7oklu kanal blok\xf6r\xfc (K, Na, Ca, \u03b2) \u2192 geni\u015f spektrum antiaritmi; tiroit, akci\u011fer, karaci\u011fer toksisitesi","ACE inhibit\xf6r\xfc \xf6ks\xfcr\xfck mekanizmas\u0131: Bradikinin y\u0131k\u0131m\u0131 azal\u0131r \u2192 birikim \u2192 hava yolu kinin resept\xf6r\xfc; ARB bradikinin art\u0131rmaz \u2192 \xf6ks\xfcr\xfck yok","Di\xfcretikler kar\u015f\u0131la\u015ft\u0131rma: Tiyazid (DCT, distal) \u2192 hafif HT; Loop (Henle kal\u0131n \xe7\u0131kan, en g\xfc\xe7l\xfc) \u2192 KY + \xf6dem; K-tutucu (toplay\u0131c\u0131 t\xfcb\xfcl: spironolakton antidot Conn) \u2192 K kayb\u0131n\u0131 \xf6nler","Kalsiyum kanal blok\xf6rleri: Dihidropiridin (nifedipin, amlodipin) \u2192 vask\xfcler > kardiyak; Non-DHP (verapamil, diltiazem) \u2192 kalp h\u0131z\u0131 \u2193 + kontraktilite \u2193; her iki s\u0131n\u0131f HT + anjin","Amiodaron etkile\u015fimleri: CYP2D6 + CYP3A4 + P-glikoprotein inhibisyonu; warfarin doz %30-50 azalt; digoksin toksisitesi \u2191; QT uzat\u0131r","\u0130vabradine: Funny current (If) inhibit\xf6r\xfc; sin\xfcs d\xfc\u011f\xfcm\xfc h\u0131z\u0131n\u0131 azalt\u0131r; kontraktilite etkilemez; KY + kronik anjinde kullan\u0131l\u0131r"],t.s)
