B.a4B=s(["H\xfccre hasar\u0131 nedenleri: Hipoksi (en s\u0131k), toksinler, enfeksiyon, imm\xfcn, genetik, beslenme","Geri d\xf6n\xfc\u015f\xfcml\xfc hasar: H\xfccre \u015fi\u015fmesi (ER + mitokondri \u015fi\u015fer), ya\u011flanma","Geri d\xf6n\xfc\u015f\xfcms\xfcz hasar: Mitokondri membran potansiyeli kaybolur, Ca\xb2\u207a girer, lizozom patlar","Nekroz: Patolojik h\xfccre \xf6l\xfcm\xfc; inflamasyon tetikler; koag\xfclatif (MI), likefaktif (beyin), kaze\xf6z (TB), ya\u011f nekrozu (pankreas)","Apoptoz: Programl\u0131 \xf6l\xfcm; inflamasyon olmaks\u0131z\u0131n; kaspaz aktivasyonu; b\xfcz\xfclme + apoptotik cisimcikler","\u0130skemik hasar: ATP \u2193 \u2192 Na/K pompa durur \u2192 h\xfccre \u015fi\u015fer \u2192 Ca\xb2\u207a girer \u2192 enzim aktivasyonu \u2192 h\xfccre \xf6l\xfcm\xfc","Apoptoz yolaklar\u0131: \u0130ntrinsik (mitokondri \u2192 sitokrom c \u2192 apoptozom \u2192 kaspaz 9 \u2192 efekt\xf6r kaspazlar) + Ekstrinsik (Fas/TNFR \u2192 kaspaz 8); her iki yolak birle\u015fir","Nekroptoz: Programl\u0131 nekroz; kaspazdan ba\u011f\u0131ms\u0131z; RIPK3/MLKL arac\u0131l\u0131; RIPK1 inhibit\xf6rleri ara\u015ft\u0131r\u0131l\u0131yor","Reperf\xfczyon hasar\u0131: \u0130skemi sonras\u0131 kan d\xf6n\xfcnce ROS patlamas\u0131 + Ca\xb2\u207a a\u015f\u0131r\u0131 y\xfcklenmesi + mitokondri \u015fi\u015fmesi; kardiyoprotektif strateji aktif alan","H\xfccre \xf6l\xfcm\xfc belirte\xe7leri: LDH (doku hasar\u0131 genel) + AST/ALT (karaci\u011fer) + Troponin (kalp) + CK-MB (kas) + amilaz/lipaz (pankreas)",'Lizozom permeabilizasyonu: Katepsin B/D sitozole s\u0131zar \u2192 kaspaz ba\u011f\u0131ms\u0131z h\xfccre \xf6l\xfcm\xfc; "lizosomal h\xfccre \xf6l\xfcm yola\u011f\u0131"; Gaucher hastal\u0131\u011f\u0131nda birikir'],t.s)
