B.a80=s(["Akut inflamasyon: Vask\xfcler (vazodilasyon, permeabilite \u2191) + h\xfccresel (n\xf6trofil g\xf6\xe7\xfc)","Kronik inflamasyon: Makrofaj + lenfosit + fibroblast; doku hasar\u0131 + fibrozis","Gran\xfclomat\xf6z inflamasyon: Makrofaj \u2192 epiteloid h\xfccre \u2192 dev h\xfccre; TB (kaze\xf6z), sarkoidoz (kaze\xf6zsuz)","Kemokin: IL-8 \u2192 n\xf6trofil \xe7ekilir; MCP-1 \u2192 monosit \xe7ekilir","Sitokin: TNF-\u03b1, IL-1, IL-6 \u2192 ate\u015f + akut faz yan\u0131t\u0131 + ka\u015feksi","L\xf6kosit g\xf6\xe7\xfc: Marjinasyon \u2192 yuvarlanma (selektin) \u2192 adezyon (integrin-ICAM) \u2192 transmigrasyon","Vazoaktif mediat\xf6rler: Histamin (mast h\xfccre, h\u0131zl\u0131) + Serotonin (trombosit) \u2192 permeabilite \u2191 + vazodilasyon; bradikinin \u2192 a\u011fr\u0131 + vazodilasyon","Ara\u015fidonik asit yolaklar\u0131: COX \u2192 PGE\u2082 (ate\u015f/a\u011fr\u0131), TXA\u2082 (trombosit), PGI\u2082 (vazodilasyon); LOX \u2192 LTB\u2084 (n\xf6trofil kemotaksi), LTC\u2084/D\u2084 (bronkokonstriksiyon); NSA\u0130\u0130 COX bloke eder","Kompleman inflamasyon etkisi: C3a + C5a anafilatoksin \u2192 mast h\xfccre degran\xfclasyon; C5a en g\xfc\xe7l\xfc n\xf6trofil kemotaksin; C3b opsonizasyon; MAC (C5b-9) h\xfccre lizisi","\u0130nflamasyon \xe7\xf6z\xfcnmesi: Lipoksinler + resolvinler (omega-3 t\xfcrevi) \u2192 anti-inflamatuvar; n\xf6trofil apoptozu + makrofaj fagositozu; POMC \u2192 melanokortinler","Fibrin\xf6z eks\xfcda: Pleura, perikard, periton gibi ser\xf6z y\xfczeylerde; fibrin a\u011f\u0131; yap\u0131\u015fma + iyile\u015fme veya kronikle\u015fme"],t.s)
