B.a_T=s(["Benign t\xfcm\xf6r: Kaps\xfcll\xfc, yava\u015f b\xfcy\xfcr, metastaz yapmaz; isim: -om (adenoma, fibroma)","Malign t\xfcm\xf6r: \u0130nvaziv, metastaz yapar; epitel \u2192 karsinom; mezenkimal \u2192 sarkom","Metastaz yollar\u0131: Lenfatik (karsinom s\u0131k), hematojen (sarkom s\u0131k, karaci\u011fer+akci\u011fer), direkt yay\u0131l\u0131m, peritoneal","Proto-onkogen \u2192 Onkogen: Kazan\u0131m-of-function; tek allel yeterli (dominant); \xf6rn. RAS, HER2/neu","T\xfcm\xf6r bask\u0131lay\u0131c\u0131 gen: Kay\u0131p-of-function; iki allel kayb\u0131 gerekir (Knudson 2-hit); \xf6rn. Rb, TP53, BRCA",'TP53 mutasyonu: En s\u0131k t\xfcm\xf6rlerde; "genomun gardiyan\u0131"; Li-Fraumeni sendromu',"Paraneoplastik sendrom: T\xfcm\xf6r\xfcn uzaktan etkisi; PTHrP (hiperkalsemi), ACTH (Cushing), SIADH (k\xfc\xe7\xfck h\xfccreli)","Onkogen aktivasyon mekanizmalar\u0131: Nokta mutasyon (RAS G12V), amplifikasyon (HER2/neu meme Ca), translokasyon (BCR-ABL KML), promotor metilasyonu kayb\u0131","T\xfcm\xf6r evreleme vs derece: Evre (yay\u0131l\u0131m: T-N-M sistemi, klinik anlam) vs Derece (diferansiyasyon: iyi/orta/k\xf6t\xfc \u2192 anaplazi, mitoz, n\xfckleer polimorfizm)","Anjiyogenez: VEGF \u2192 t\xfcm\xf6r neovask\xfclarizasyonu; t\xfcm\xf6r\xfcn 2 mm \xfczeri b\xfcy\xfcmesi i\xe7in \u015fart; bevacizumab anti-VEGF tedavisi","\u0130mm\xfcn ka\xe7\u0131\u015f: PD-L1 T h\xfccreye PD-1 ba\u011flar \u2192 imm\xfcn bask\u0131; anti-PD1/PD-L1 (nivolumab, pembrolizumab) \u2192 imm\xfcnoterapi; CTLA-4 ipilimumab"],t.s)
