B.a8Z=s(["Polisitemia vera: JAK2 mutasyonu \u2192 eritrosit \u2191; hiperviskozite \u2192 tromboz","CML: BCR-ABL f\xfczyon (Philadelphia kromozomu, t(9;22)) \u2192 imatinib tedavisi","AML: Myeloid blast \u2191; Auer \xe7ubuklar\u0131; DIC riski (M3-APL)","Hodgkin lenfoma: Reed-Sternberg h\xfccreleri (b\xfcy\xfck \xe7ift nukle\xfcsl\xfc); EBV ili\u015fkili; gen\xe7 erkek","Non-Hodgkin lenfoma: Folik\xfcler (t(14;18), BCL-2) \u2192 indolan; Burkitt (t(8;14), MYC) \u2192 agresif","Multipl myelom: Plazma h\xfccre neoplazisi; M protein, bence-jones protein\xfcri, kemik lezyonu, renal yetmezlik","ALL (akut lenfoblastik l\xf6semi): \xc7ocuklarda en s\u0131k kanser; TdT (+); B-ALL (CD19+) veya T-ALL; vincristin+prednizon+asparaginaz; prognoz \xe7ocukta iyi","Esansiyel trombositemi: JAK2; trombosit >600.000; tromboz + kanama paradoksu; aspirin + hidroksi\xfcre","Myelodisplastik sendrom (MDS): Pansitopeni + kemik ili\u011fi displazisi; ya\u015fl\u0131; klonal; ring sideroblast (5q silme); azasitidin; y\xfcksek riskli \u2192 K\u0130T","Lenfoma evreleme: Ann Arbor: I (tek b\xf6lge) \u2192 II (diyafram ayn\u0131 taraf\u0131) \u2192 III (her iki taraf) \u2192 IV (ekstranodal); B semptomlar\u0131 (ate\u015f+terleme+>%10 kilo kayb\u0131) prognoz k\xf6t\xfc","Hemofagositik lenfohisitiositoz (HLH): Makrofaj f\u0131rt\u0131nas\u0131; ate\u015f + splenomegali + sitopeni + ferritin \u2191\u2191; tetik: EBV, viral, otoimm\xfcn; siklosporin + etoposid"],t.s)
