B.a1U=s(["Displazi: H\xfccre boyutu/\u015fekli/n\xfckleus d\xfczensizli\u011fi; preneoplastik; reversibl","Metaplazi: Bir olgun h\xfccre tipinin yerine ba\u015fkas\u0131; \xf6rn. Barrett (yass\u0131\u2192kolumnar), goblet h\xfccre","Atrofi: Organ/doku k\xfc\xe7\xfclmesi; a\xe7l\u0131k, sinirsel, diskullan\u0131m, ya\u015flanma","Hipertrofi: H\xfccre b\xfcy\xfcmesi (kalp kas\u0131, uterus); strese adaptasyon","Hiperplazi: H\xfccre say\u0131s\u0131 artar (b\xf6l\xfcnebilen h\xfccrelerde); endometriyal, prostatik","Amiloidoz: \u03b2-pleated sheet fibril birikimi; kalp, b\xf6brek, karaci\u011fer, dalak; AA (kronik inflamasyon), AL (myelom)",'Hemokromatoz: Fe birikimi; karaci\u011fer + pankreas + kalp + eklemler; "bronz diyabet"',"Displazi\u2192Karsinom in situ\u2192\u0130nvaziv: S\xfcreklilik; CIS bazal membran\u0131 ge\xe7memi\u015f; invazyon ge\xe7ince metastaz riski; serviks CIN s\u0131n\u0131fland\u0131rmas\u0131","Reaktif oksijen t\xfcrleri (ROS): O\u2082\u207b, H\u2082O\u2082, OH\u2022; lipid peroksidasyonu + DNA hasar\u0131; antioksidanlar (SOD, katalaz, glutatyon) korur; kronik inflamasyon ROS","Wilson hastal\u0131\u011f\u0131: Cu birikimi; karaci\u011fer + beyin + Kayser-Fleischer halkas\u0131 (kornea); seruloplazmin \u2193; penisilamin tedavisi","Porfiriler: Hem sentez enzim defekti; akut (n\xf6ropsi + kar\u0131n a\u011fr\u0131s\u0131 + idrar koyula\u015fmas\u0131) vs kutan\xf6z; porfobilinogen idrar; hematin akut tedavi"],t.s)
