B.a3S=s(["Yap\u0131sal: Serbest sinir u\xe7lar\u0131 / Kaps\xfcll\xfc / \xd6zelle\u015fmi\u015f h\xfccreler","Lokalizasyon: Eksterosept\xf6r (d\u0131\u015f) / \u0130nterosept\xf6r (i\xe7) / Propriosept\xf6r (hareket)","Fonksiyon: Kemoresept\xf6r, mekanoresept\xf6r, termoresept\xf6r, nosisept\xf6r, fotoresept\xf6r","Genel duyu: V\xfccuda da\u011f\u0131lm\u0131\u015f; \xd6zel duyu: \xd6zel organ (g\xf6z, kulak\u2026)","Adaptasyon h\u0131z\u0131: H\u0131zl\u0131 adaptasyonlu (Meissner, Pacini \u2014 sal\u0131n\u0131m alg\u0131lar, adaptasyon sonras\u0131 sessiz) vs Yava\u015f adaptasyonlu (Merkel, Ruffini \u2014 s\xfcrekli uyaran izler)","Transd\xfcksiyon: Uyaran\u0131n elektrik sinyaline d\xf6n\xfc\u015f\xfcm\xfc; resept\xf6r potansiyeli olu\u015fturur; e\u015fi\u011fe ula\u015f\u0131rsa afferent sinirde AP","Reseptif alan: Bir n\xf6ronun yan\u0131t verdi\u011fi deri alan\u0131; k\xfc\xe7\xfck alan \u2192 ince dokunma ayr\u0131m\u0131 (parmak ucu); b\xfcy\xfck alan \u2192 kaba lokalizasyon (s\u0131rt)","Lateral inhibisyon: Kom\u015fu n\xf6ronlar birbirini inhibe eder \u2192 keskin iki nokta ayr\u0131m\u0131; dorsal boynuzda; kaba lokalizasyonu netle\u015ftirir","A\u011fr\u0131 s\u0131n\u0131fland\u0131rmas\u0131: Nosiseptif (doku hasar\u0131 \u2014 akut, A-\u03b4 h\u0131zl\u0131 + C lifleri yava\u015f) vs N\xf6ropatik (sinir hasar\u0131 \u2014 yanma, diyabet + herpes) vs Visseral (i\xe7 organ \u2014 yans\u0131yan a\u011fr\u0131)","Yans\u0131yan a\u011fr\u0131: Visseral sinir dermatom ile ayn\u0131 spinal segmente girer; kalp a\u011fr\u0131s\u0131 sol kola yans\u0131r (C8-T1); safra kesesi sa\u011f omuz (frenik sinir C3-C5)"],t.s)
