B.a00=s(["5 tat: Tuzlu (Na\u207a), Ek\u015fi (H\u207a), Tatl\u0131/Ac\u0131/Umami (G protein)","\xd6n 2/3 dil: CN VII (fasiyal); Arka 1/3: CN IX (glossofaringeal)","Koku: Olfakt\xf6r epitel \u2192 Lamina kribroza (etmoid) \u2192 Olfakt\xf6r bulb","Koku TEK duyudur ki talamusta sinaps yapmadan kortekse gider","Anozmia: Koku kayb\u0131 (travma, antibiyotik, ya\u015flanma)","Tat tomurcuklar\u0131: Her papillada; circumvallate (b\xfcy\xfck) + fungiform (mantar) + foliat; filiform papilla tat i\xe7ermez","Tat transd\xfcksiyonu: Tuzlu/ek\u015fi iyon kanal\u0131 a\xe7ar; Tatl\u0131/ac\u0131/umami \u2192 GPCR \u2192 IP\u2083 \u2192 Ca\xb2\u207a \u2192 n\xf6rotransmitter salg\u0131s\u0131 \u2192 CN VII/IX/X","Koku fizyolojisi: Volatil kimyasal \u2192 olfakt\xf6r resept\xf6r n\xf6ronu GPCR \u2192 cAMP \u2191 \u2192 depolarizasyon \u2192 olfakt\xf6r bulbda mitral h\xfccre \u2192 piriform korteks (koku haf\u0131zas\u0131)",'Olfakt\xf6r adaptasyon: Ayn\u0131 kokuya uzun s\xfcre maruz kal\u0131nca yan\u0131t azal\u0131r; resept\xf6r d\xfczeyinde de\u011fil n\xf6ral adaptasyon; koku "hayatta kalma" ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 \u2192 aniden yeniden fark\u0131ndal\u0131k m\xfcmk\xfcn',"COVID-19 ve anozmia: SARS-CoV-2 ACE2 resept\xf6r\xfc ile olfakt\xf6r epitel destek h\xfccrelerine girer; olfakt\xf6r n\xf6rona direkt hasar \u2192 uzun COVID anozmia; \xe7o\u011fu hasta aylar i\xe7inde d\xfczelir"],t.s)
