B.a4d=s(["D\u0131\u015f kulak: Aurikula + d\u0131\u015f kulak yolu + timpanik membran","Orta kulak: Malleus\u2013\u0130nkus\u2013Stapes ossik\xfcl zinciri (ses amplifikasyonu)","\xd6staki t\xfcp\xfc: Timpanik membran\u0131n iki yan\u0131ndaki hava bas\u0131nc\u0131n\u0131 e\u015fitler","Koklea: Skala vestib\xfcli + skala timpani + koklear kanal","Baziler membran tonotopisi: Y\xfcksek frekans tabanda, d\xfc\u015f\xfck frekans apekste","Corti organ\u0131 sa\xe7 h\xfccreleri: Stereosilia e\u011filmesi \u2192 iyon kanal\u0131 a\xe7\u0131l\u0131r","CN VIII (vestib\xfclok\xf6lear): Ses + denge bilgisini beyin sap\u0131na iletir","Denge: Utrik\xfcl/sakk\xfcl (do\u011frusal ivme); Semisirk\xfcler kanallar (d\xf6nme)","Otolitler: CaCO\u2083 kristalleri, yer\xe7ekimi y\xf6n\xfcn\xfc belirler"],t.s)
