B.a3A=s(["G\xf6z katmanlar\u0131: Fibr\xf6z tunik (sklera+kornea) / Vask\xfcler tunik (uvea) / N\xf6ral tunik (retina)","\xd6n bo\u015fluk: Ak\xf6z humor; Arka bo\u015fluk: Vitreos humor","\xc7ubuklar (rod): Rodopsin, az \u0131\u015f\u0131k, siyah-beyaz g\xf6rme","Koniler (cone): 3 opsin (R/G/B), renkli g\xf6rme, fovea","Fovea: Yaln\u0131zca koniler, en y\xfcksek keskinlik (1:1 gangliyon)","Fototransd\xfcksiyon: 11-cis-retinal \u2192 all-trans-retinal (foton \u2192 G protein)","Ekstraok\xfcler kaslar: CN III \xe7o\u011fu, CN IV superior oblik, CN VI lateral rektus"],t.s)
