B.a0G=s(["Meissner: Hafif dokunma (<50 Hz), parmak u\xe7lar\u0131","Pacini: Derin bask\u0131, y\xfcksek frekans (~250 Hz), derin deri","Merkel: D\xfc\u015f\xfck frekans (5\u201315 Hz), epidermis\u2013dermis birle\u015fimi","Ruffini: Deri gerilmesi, eklem kaps\xfclleri","Kas i\u011fci\u011fi: Kas uzamas\u0131n\u0131 alg\u0131lar \u2192 alfa motor n\xf6ron \u2192 gerilme refleksi","Golgi tendon organ\u0131: A\u015f\u0131r\u0131 gerilmede kas\u0131 inhibe eder (koruyucu)","Bell-Magendie: Dorsal k\xf6k duyusal; ventral k\xf6k motor","Dorsal kolon: \u0130nce dokunma, titre\u015fim, propriosepsiyon","Spinotalamik traktus: A\u011fr\u0131 ve s\u0131cakl\u0131k (giri\u015f seviyesinde \xe7aprazlar)","Kortikospinal yol: %85-90 med\xfcllada \xe7aprazlar (decussatio pyramidum)"],t.s)
