B.a9i=s(["Katabolizma: B\xfcy\xfck \u2192 k\xfc\xe7\xfck + enerji \xfcretir","Anabolizma: K\xfc\xe7\xfck \u2192 b\xfcy\xfck + enerji harcar","ATP: Adenin + riboz + 3 fosfat; 2-3 y\xfcksek enerjili ba\u011f kritik","Redoks: Oksidasyon (e\u207b kayb\u0131) + red\xfcksiyon (e\u207b kazan\u0131m\u0131)","NAD\u207a/NADH ve FAD/FADH\u2082: Elektron ta\u015f\u0131y\u0131c\u0131 koenzimler","Cori d\xf6ng\xfcs\xfc: Kas laktik asit \u2192 karaci\u011fer \u2192 glukoz \u2192 kas","Metabolik h\u0131z: Bazal metabolizma h\u0131z\u0131 (BMR); ya\u015fla %2/dekad azal\u0131r; ya\u011fs\u0131z k\xfctle azal\u0131nca d\xfc\u015fer; tiroit hormonu en g\xfc\xe7l\xfc d\xfczenleyici","Enerji kaynaklar\u0131 \xf6nceli\u011fi: 1. Glikoz (beyin ve eritrosit i\xe7in zorunlu) \u2192 2. Glikojen depolar\u0131 \u2192 3. Ya\u011f asitleri \u2192 4. Amino asitler (son \xe7are)","Metabolizman\u0131n ortak ara \xfcr\xfcn\xfc: Asetil-CoA; karbohidrat + ya\u011f + protein katabolizmas\u0131 sonunda olu\u015fur \u2192 Krebs d\xf6ng\xfcs\xfcne girer veya ya\u011f sentezi i\xe7in kullan\u0131l\u0131r","Postabsorptif durum: Son yemekten >4 saat; glikojenoliz ba\u015flar \u2192 a\xe7l\u0131kta ya\u011f + keton bask\u0131n; sabah \xf6l\xe7\xfcm referans\u0131","Termojenez: Enerji metabolik \u0131s\u0131ya d\xf6n\xfc\u015f\xfcr; titreme (kas ATP) + titremesiz (UCP-1 kahverengi ya\u011f dokusu, norepinefrin) + egzersiz; v\xfccut \u0131s\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 37\xb0C tutar"],t.s)
B.afp=new A.D("Genel Metabolizma",B.a9i)
B.a1b=s(["Yeri: Sitozol (oksijen gerektirmez)","Girdi: 1 glukoz + 2 ATP; \xc7\u0131kt\u0131: 2 pir\xfcvat + 4 ATP + 2 NADH","Net kazan\xe7: 2 ATP + 2 NADH","H\u0131z k\u0131s\u0131tlay\u0131c\u0131 enzim: Fosfofr\xfcktokinaz-1 (PFK-1)","Oksijensiz ortamda: Pir\xfcvat \u2192 laktat (fermentasyon)","Eritrositler mitokondri ta\u015f\u0131maz \u2192 s\xfcrekli fermentasyon","Glikoliz basamaklar\u0131: Glukoz \u2192 Hekzokinaz ile Glukoz-6-P \u2192 Fruktokinaz + PFK-1 \u2192 Fruktoz-1,6-bisP \u2192 Aldolaz ile 2\xd7 DHAP ve GAP \u2192 2\xd7 1,3-bisfosfogliserat \u2192 2\xd7 3-PG \u2192 2\xd7 2-PG \u2192 2\xd7 PEP \u2192 Pir\xfcvat kinaz ile 2\xd7 Pir\xfcvat","PFK-1 d\xfczenlenmesi: ATP (inhibit\xf6r) + AMP/ADP (aktivat\xf6r) + Fruktoz-2,6-bisfosfat (aktivat\xf6r, ins\xfclinle artar); bu d\xfczenleme glikoliz/glukoneogenezi koordine eder","Pir\xfcvat kaderi: O\u2082 varsa \u2192 mitokondri \u2192 asetil-CoA (PDH enzimi, B1 gerekli); O\u2082 yoksa \u2192 laktat (laktat dehidrojenaz); oksijende alkol \u2192 sadece maya (etanol fermentasyon)","Hekzokinaz vs Glukokinaz: Hekzokinaz \u2014 d\xfc\u015f\xfck Km, t\xfcm dokular, inhibisyon G-6-P ile; Glukokinaz \u2014 y\xfcksek Km, karaci\u011fer+\u03b2 h\xfccre, ins\xfclin \u2191 ile artar; kan glukozu sens\xf6r\xfc","Laktik asidoz: Laktat birikimi (>2 mEq/L); tip A: hipoksemi; tip B: metformin (nadir), sepsis, karaci\u011fer yetmezli\u011fi; tedavi: altta yatan neden + NaHCO\u2083 tart\u0131\u015fmal\u0131"],t.s)
B.aiE=new A.D("Glikoliz",B.a1b)
B.a1S=s(["Yeri: Mitokondri matrisi","Pir\xfcvat \u2192 Asetil-CoA (pir\xfcvat dehidrojenaz, B1 gerekir)","Asetil-CoA (2C) + Oksaloasetat (4C) \u2192 Sitrat (6C)","Her tur: 3 NADH + 1 FADH\u2082 + 1 GTP (\u2192ATP)","CO\u2082 sal\u0131n\u0131r: \u0130zositrat\u2192\u03b1-ketoglutarat, \u03b1-ketoglutarat\u2192s\xfcksinil-CoA","S\xfcksinat dehidrojenaz: FADH\u2082 olu\u015fturur (Complex II)","Krebs basamaklar\u0131: Sitrat \u2192 Akonitaz \u2192 \u0130zositrat \u2192 \u0130zositrat DH (NADH + CO\u2082, vitamin B3 ba\u011fl\u0131) \u2192 \u03b1-ketoglutarat \u2192 \u03b1-KG DH (NADH + CO\u2082, B1+B2+lipoik asit) \u2192 S\xfcksinil-CoA \u2192 S\xfcksinil-CoA sentetaz (GTP) \u2192 S\xfcksinat \u2192 S\xfcksinat DH (FADH\u2082, Complex II) \u2192 Fumatat \u2192 Malat \u2192 Malat DH (NADH) \u2192 Oksaloasetat","Pir\xfcvat dehidrojenaz kompleksi: PDH = E1 (tiamin, B1) + E2 (lipoik asit) + E3 (FAD, B2); NADH + asetil-CoA taraf\u0131ndan inhibe; ADP + Ca\xb2\u207a + pir\xfcvat taraf\u0131ndan aktive edilir","PDH eksikli\u011fi: B1 eksikli\u011fi (Wernicke) + genetik PDH defekti; pir\xfcvat \u2192 laktat; tedavi: tiamin + ketojenik diyet; Leigh hastal\u0131\u011f\u0131 (genetik PDH)","Krebs ve amino asit katabolizmas\u0131: Glutamat \u2192 \u03b1-ketoglutarat; aspartat \u2192 oksaloasetat; serin \u2192 pir\xfcvat; valin/izol\xf6sin/l\xf6sin \u2192 asetil-CoA ve/veya Krebs ara \xfcr\xfcnleri","1 glukozdan Krebs verimi: 2 Asetil-CoA \u2192 2 tur; toplam 6 NADH + 2 FADH\u2082 + 2 GTP; bu elektronlar ETC'ye giderek daha fazla ATP \xfcretir"],t.s)
B.aft=new A.D("Krebs D\xf6ng\xfcs\xfc",B.a1S)
B.a0d=s(["Yeri: \u0130\xe7 mitokondri zar\u0131 (Complex I\u2013IV)","NADH ve FADH\u2082 elektronlar\u0131 \u2192 proton gradyan\u0131 olu\u015fur","ATP sentaz (Complex V): H\u207a ak\u0131\u015f\u0131 \u2192 \u015faft d\xf6ner \u2192 ADP+Pi \u2192 ATP","Son elektron al\u0131c\u0131s\u0131: O\u2082 + 4e\u207b + 4H\u207a \u2192 2H\u2082O","1 glukozdan toplam ~30-32 ATP (modern hesap)","ETC kompleksleri: Complex I (NADH DH, FMN+Fe-S, en b\xfcy\xfck, 4H\u207a pompa) \u2192 Ubikinonin (CoQ) \u2192 Complex II (S\xfcksinat DH, FADH\u2082 giri\u015f, H\u207a pompalamaz) \u2192 Sitokrom bc1 (Complex III, 4H\u207a) \u2192 Sitokrom c \u2192 Complex IV (Sitokrom oksidaz, 2H\u207a, O\u2082 \u2192 H\u2082O)","NADH vs FADH\u2082 ATP verimi: NADH Complex I'e girer \u2192 ~2.5 ATP; FADH\u2082 Complex II'ye girer \u2192 ~1.5 ATP; toplam 1 glukoz aerobik \u2192 ~30-32 ATP (eski 36-38 ATP)","ATP sentaz (chemiosmosis): Proton motive force = \u0394pH + \u0394\u03a8; F\u2080 (zar i\xe7i, proton kanal\u0131) + F\u2081 (matriks, katalitik k\u0131s\u0131m); \u03b3 \u015faft her 3 H\u207a i\xe7in 1 ATP sentezler","ETC inhibit\xf6rleri: Siyan\xfcr (Complex IV inhibit\xf6r\xfc, O\u2082 kullan\u0131m\u0131 durur \u2192 sitotoksik hipoksi); Rotenon (Complex I); Oligomisin (ATP sentaz); 2,4-DNP (proton s\u0131zmas\u0131 \u2192 \u0131s\u0131 \u2192 zay\u0131flama ilac\u0131 tarihsel)","Glikozun toplam ATP hesab\u0131: Glikoliz 2 ATP + 2 NADH (sitoplazmik) + Pir\xfcvat DH 2 NADH + Krebs 6 NADH + 2 FADH\u2082 + 2 GTP \u2192 ETC'de NADH\xd72.5 + FADH\u2082\xd71.5 + GTP; modern hesap 30-32 ATP"],t.s)
B.agw=new A.D("Elektron Transport & Oksidatif Fosforilasyon",B.a0d)
B.YF=s(["Beta-oksidasyon: Ya\u011f asitleri \u2192 Asetil-CoA + NADH + FADH\u2082","Karnitin: Uzun zincirli ya\u011f asitlerini i\xe7 mitokondri zar\u0131ndan ta\u015f\u0131r","Keton cisimleri: A\xe7l\u0131k/DKA \u2192 asetoasetat, \u03b2-hidroksib\xfctirat, aseton","Glukoneogenez: Laktat, gliserol, amino asitlerden glukoz sentezi","Glikojenoliz: Glikojen \u2192 glukoz (glikojen fosforilaz)","Deaminasyon: Amino asitlerden NH\u2082 uzakla\u015f\u0131r \u2192 enerji kullan\u0131m\u0131","Lipoliz basamaklar\u0131: Trigliserit \u2192 lipoprotein lipaz (kapillerlerde) + hormon duyarl\u0131 lipaz (adiposit, epinefrin/glukagon aktive eder, ins\xfclin inhibe eder) \u2192 serbest ya\u011f asitleri + gliserol \u2192 kan","Beta-oksidasyon detay: Ya\u011f asidi + CoA \u2192 A\xe7il-CoA (sitozol) \u2192 Karnitin ile mitokondri i\xe7i \u2192 2 C kopar her turda + NADH + FADH\u2082 + Asetil-CoA; palmitat (16C) \u2192 7 tur \u2192 8 Asetil-CoA + 7 NADH + 7 FADH\u2082 = ~129 ATP","Ketogenez: A\u015f\u0131r\u0131 Asetil-CoA (karaci\u011fer) + oksaloasetat yetersizli\u011fi \u2192 HMG-CoA \u2192 \u03b2-hidroksib\xfctirat + asetoasetat + aseton; beyin keton kullanabilir ama eritrosit kullanamaz","\xdcre d\xf6ng\xfcs\xfc: Amino asit katabolizmas\u0131 \u2192 NH\u2083 \u2192 karaci\u011fer \u2192 Karbamoil-P \u2192 Sitr\xfcllin \u2192 Arjininos\xfcksinat \u2192 Arjinin \u2192 \xdcre + Ornitin; kusur \u2192 hiperammoni + ensefalopati","Esansiyel amino asitler: PVT TIM HALL (Fenilalanin, Val, Trp, Thr, \u0130zol\xf6sin, Met, His, Arg, Leu, Lys); v\xfccutta sentezlenemez; g\u0131dadan al\u0131nmal\u0131","Glukojenik vs Ketojenik AA: Glukojenik (Ala, Asp, Gln, His, Ser) \u2192 Krebs ara \xfcr\xfcn\xfc \u2192 glukoneogenez; Saf ketojenik (Leu, Lys) \u2192 Asetil-CoA; her ikisi (Phe, Trp, Tyr, \u0130zol\xf6sin) \u2192 hem glukoz hem keton"],t.s)
B.ahn=new A.D("Lipid & Protein Metabolizmas\u0131",B.YF)
B.a6u=s(["Katabolik: Kortizol, glukagon, epinefrin (kan glukozu \u2191)","Anabolik: \u0130ns\xfclin, GH, IGF, testosteron, \xf6strojen","Cushing: Kortizol fazlas\u0131 \u2192 hiperglisemi, ay y\xfcz\xfc, kas g\xfc\xe7s\xfczl\xfc\u011f\xfc","Addison: Kortizol eksikli\u011fi \u2192 hipoglisemi, hipotansiyon, hiperkalemi","NAD\u207a \u2190 B3 (niasin); FAD \u2190 B2 (riboflavin)","B1 (tiamin): Pir\xfcvat dehidrojenaz kofakt\xf6r\xfc; eksikli\u011fi = Wernicke","B7 (biyotin): Karboksilasyon; B5 (pantotenik asit): CoA yap\u0131s\u0131","\u0130ns\xfclin metabolik etkileri: Glukoz al\u0131m\u0131n\u0131 art\u0131r\u0131r (GLUT4 \u2014 karaci\u011fer/kas/ya\u011f) + Glikojen sentezi \u2191 + Lipolizi inhibe + Protein sentezi \u2191; t\xfcm anabolik etkilerin ana d\xfczenleyicisi","Glukagon metabolik etkileri: Karaci\u011fer glikojenolizini + glukoneogenezi \u2191; ya\u011f dokusunda lipolizi \u2191 \u2192 keton olu\u015fumu; a\xe7l\u0131kta ve egzersizde bask\u0131n","Vitaminler ve enzimler: B1 (PDH+\u03b1-KG DH) + B2 (FAD/FADH\u2082, Complex I, II, s\xfcksinat DH) + B3 (NAD+/NADH) + B5 (CoA yap\u0131s\u0131) + B7 (pir\xfcvat karboksilaz+asetil-CoA karboksilaz) + lipoik asit (PDH kompleksi)","Niasin eksikli\u011fi (B3): Pellagra = Dermatit + Diyare + Demans + \xd6l\xfcm; m\u0131s\u0131r bask\u0131n diyette (triptofandan niasin sentezi azal\u0131r); bulant\u0131 en s\u0131k yan etki niasin suplemanda","Riboflavin (B2) eksikli\u011fi: Glosal (dil iltihab\u0131) + korneal vask\xfclarizasyon + angular stomatit; NAD+ sentezi de bozulur (B3 ba\u011f\u0131ml\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131)"],t.s)
