B.a8m=s(["ADH (vazopressin): Hipotalamusta \xfcretilir, arka hipofizden sal\u0131n\u0131r","Etki: Toplay\u0131c\u0131 t\xfcb\xfclde aquaporin g\xf6\xe7\xfc \u2192 su geri emilimi \u2191","Osmoresept\xf6rler: Plazma osmolalitesi \u2191 \u2192 ADH \u2191 + susama","Alkol: ADH sal\u0131n\u0131m\u0131 inhibe eder \u2192 di\xfcrez","Diyabetes insipidus: ADH eksikli\u011fi veya diren\xe7 \u2192 poli\xfcri","ADH tetikleyicileri: Plazma osmolalite \u2191 (en g\xfc\xe7l\xfc) + kan hacmi \u2193 + kan bas\u0131nc\u0131 \u2193 + a\u011fr\u0131 + stres + bulant\u0131; etanol ve so\u011fuk ADH bask\u0131lar","Aquaporin mekanizmas\u0131: ADH \u2192 V2 resept\xf6r\xfc (toplay\u0131c\u0131 t\xfcb\xfcl) \u2192 cAMP \u2191 \u2192 PKA \u2192 AQP2 vezik\xfclden apikale hareket \u2192 su ge\xe7irgenli\u011fi \u2191; V2 mutasyonu \u2192 nefr\xfcjenik DI","SIADH (uygunsuz ADH sendromu): ADH fazla salg\u0131lanmas\u0131 \u2192 su tutulmas\u0131 \u2192 hiponatremi + idrar sodyumu \u2191 + idrar konsantre; neden: k\xfc\xe7\xfck h\xfccreli akci\u011fer kanseri, SSS hastal\u0131\u011f\u0131, ila\xe7lar","DI tipleri: Santral DI (ADH eksikli\u011fi, desmopressin tedavi) vs Nefrojenik DI (b\xf6brek V2 yan\u0131ts\u0131zl\u0131\u011f\u0131, lityum, hiperkalemi, tiyazid tedavisi); polidipsi + dil\xfc idrar ortakt\u0131r","Su dengesi g\xfcnl\xfck: Al\u0131m 2500 mL (i\xe7ecek 1500 + yiyecek 700 + metabolik su 300) = \xc7\u0131k\u0131\u015f (idrar 1500 + d\u0131\u015fk\u0131 200 + ter/insensible 800); denge bozulunca ADH ve susama devreye girer"],t.s)
B.agf=new A.D("Su Dengesi & ADH",B.a8m)
B.a06=s(["RAAS: D\xfc\u015f\xfck kan bas\u0131nc\u0131/Na\u207a \u2192 renin \u2192 AnjII \u2192 aldosteron","Aldosteron: Distal t\xfcb\xfcl Na\u207a geri emilimi \u2191, K\u207a at\u0131l\u0131m\u0131 \u2191","Hiponatremi: H\xfccreler \u015fi\u015fer \u2192 beyin \xf6demi riski","Hipernatremi: H\xfccreler b\xfcz\xfcl\xfcr \u2192 n\xf6ronal disfonksiyon","Hiperkalemi: Parsiyel depolarizasyon \u2192 VF/asistoli riski","\u0130ns\xfclin: K\u207a h\xfccre i\xe7ine iter \u2192 hiperkalemi tedavisinde kullan\u0131l\u0131r","Na\u207a normali 136-145 mEq/L; v\xfccuttaki en bol ECF katyonu; osmolaliteyi belirler; h\u0131zl\u0131 d\xfczeltme tehlikeli (osmotik demiyelinasyon sentral pontin myelinoliz \u2014 kronik hiponatremi, h\u0131zl\u0131 d\xfczeltme riski)","Hiponatremi s\u0131n\u0131flamas\u0131: Hipoosmolar (en s\u0131k); ise \u2014 hipovolemik (idrar Na <20: G\u0130S kay\u0131p, terleme) vs evolemik (SIADH, hipotiroid) vs hipervolemik (KY, nefrotik, siroz)","K\u207a normali 3.5-5.0 mEq/L; ICF'te bask\u0131n katyon; membran potansiyelini belirler; b\xf6brek K\u207a dengesini korur (aldosteron, ins\xfclin, pH etkisi)","Aldosteron mekanizmas\u0131: ENaC (epitelyal Na kanal\u0131) + Na/K ATPaz art\u0131\u015f\u0131 \u2192 Na\u207a tutulumu + K\u207a at\u0131l\u0131m\u0131; mineralokortikoid resept\xf6r\xfc; spironolakton antagonist (K tutar)","Renin-anjiyotensin detay: JGA renin \u2192 Anjiyotensinojen \u2192 AnjI \u2192 ACE (akci\u011fer) \u2192 AnjII \u2192 vazokonstriksiyon (AT1) + aldosteron (adrenal) + ADH + sempatik; ACEi: \xf6ks\xfcr\xfck (bradikinin), ARB \xf6ks\xfcr\xfck yok"],t.s)
