B.a2y=s(["PTH: Ca\xb2\u207a d\xfc\u015f\xfcnce \u2191 \u2192 kemikten Ca\xb2\u207a sal\u0131n\u0131r, b\xf6brekten tutulur, D vitamini aktive","Kalsitonin: Ca\xb2\u207a y\xfcksekse tiroit C h\xfccrelerinden \u2192 Ca\xb2\u207a d\xfc\u015f\xfcr\xfcr","Hipokalsemi: Tetani, Chvostek (+), Trousseau (+), laringospazm","D vitamini: Ba\u011f\u0131rsaktan Ca\xb2\u207a emilimini art\u0131r\u0131r; eksikli\u011fi = ra\u015fitizm/osteomala\u015fi","Hiperparatiroidi: Hiperkalemi, kemik a\u011fr\u0131s\u0131, b\xf6brek ta\u015f\u0131","Kalsiyum normal de\u011fer: Total Ca 8.5-10.5 mg/dL; iyonize (biyoaktif) 1.1-1.4 mmol/L; alkaloz \u2192 iyonize Ca \u2193 \u2192 tetani; alb\xfcmin d\xfc\u015f\xfcnce total Ca d\xfc\u015fer ama iyonize normal (d\xfczeltilmi\u015f Ca form\xfcl\xfc)","PTH b\xf6brek etkileri: Ca geri emilim \u2191 (distal t\xfcb\xfcl) + Fosfat at\u0131l\u0131m\u0131 \u2191 (proksimal t\xfcb\xfcl fosfat\xfcri) + 1\u03b1-hidroksilaz aktivasyonu \u2192 aktif D vitamini \u2192 ba\u011f\u0131rsak Ca emilimi \u2191","D vitamini sentez zinciri: Deri (7-dehidrokolesterol + UVB) \u2192 D3 \u2192 Karaci\u011fer (25-OH-D3) \u2192 B\xf6brek 1\u03b1-hidroksilaz (PTH ve hipokalsemi aktive eder) \u2192 1,25-(OH)\u2082D3 (kalsitriol, aktif); CYP27B1 enzimi","Hipofosfatemi: Refeeding sendromu (a\xe7l\u0131ktan beslenmede ins\xfclin \u2192 P ve K h\xfccre i\xe7i \u2192 ciddi d\xfc\u015f\xfc\u015f) + Antasit a\u015f\u0131r\u0131 kullan\u0131m\u0131 + D vitamini eksikli\u011fi; solunum yetmezli\u011fi kritik olgularda","Hiperfosfatemi: KBH en s\u0131k (b\xf6brek fosfat atam\u0131yor); sekonder hiperparatiroidizm \u2192 kemik hasar\u0131; sevelamer (Ca i\xe7ermeyen ba\u011flay\u0131c\u0131, KBH tercih) veya kalsiyum karbonat"],t.s)
