B.a1Q=s(["Normal kan pH: 7.35\u20137.45; < 7.35 = asidoz, > 7.45 = alkaloz","Tampon: HCO\u2083\u207b/H\u2082CO\u2083 (en g\xfc\xe7l\xfc), fosfat, protein (hemoglobin)","CO\u2082 ta\u015f\u0131n\u0131m\u0131: %70 HCO\u2083\u207b, %23 karbamino-Hb, %7 \xe7\xf6z\xfcnm\xfc\u015f","Metabolik asidoz: pH\u2193, HCO\u2083\u207b\u2193; neden: DKA, laktik asidoz, ishal","Metabolik alkaloz: pH\u2191, HCO\u2083\u207b\u2191; neden: kusma (HCl kayb\u0131)","Solunum asidozu: pH\u2193, PCO\u2082\u2191; neden: hipoventilasyon (KOAH)","Solunum alkaloz: pH\u2191, PCO\u2082\u2193; neden: hiperventilasyon (anksiyete)","DKA: Metabolik asidoz + Kussmaul solunumu (kompansatuar hiperventilasyon)","Asit-baz analizi ad\u0131mlar\u0131: 1. pH (asidoz/alkaloz?) \u2192 2. PCO\u2082 (solunum mu?) \u2192 3. HCO\u2083\u207b (metabolik mi?) \u2192 4. Kompensasyon beklenen mi? \u2192 5. Anyon a\xe7\u0131\u011f\u0131 hesapla (metabolik asidozda)","Kompensasyon kurallar\u0131: Met.asidoz \u2192 PCO\u2082 = 1.5\xd7HCO\u2083\u207b+8\xb12 (Winter); Sol.asidoz akut \u2192 HCO\u2083\u207b her 10 PCO\u2082 i\xe7in +1 (kronik +3.5); Sol.alkaloz akut \u2192 HCO\u2083\u207b her 10 PCO\u2082 i\xe7in \u22122 (kronik \u22125)","Y\xfcksek AG metabolik asidoz: MUDPILES = Methanol, Uremi, DKA/Diyabetik ketoasidoz, Propilen glikol, \u0130zoniazid, Laktik asidoz, Etilen glikol, Salisilatlar; serum laktat + osmolal gap yard\u0131mc\u0131","Normal AG metabolik asidoz: Hiperkloreemik; RT\xdc (proksimal/distal/tip IV) + ishal (HCO\u2083\u207b kayb\u0131) + TPN + asetazolamid; idrar AG = Na+K\u2212Cl (pozitif \u2192 b\xf6brek, negatif \u2192 G\u0130S kay\u0131p)","Metabolik alkaloz tedavi: Kusma \u2192 NaCl + KCl; primer aldosteronizm \u2192 spironolakton; Bartter/Gitelman sendromu \u2192 K replasman; h\u0131zl\u0131 s\u0131v\u0131 verilmesi"],t.s)
