B.ZF=s(["Yer: Uterus t\xfcp\xfc distaL (ampulla)","Sperm ya\u015fam s\xfcresi: 3-5 g\xfcn; oosit: ~24 saat","Kapasitasyon: Sperm membran\u0131ndan kolesterol uzakla\u015f\u0131r \u2192 akrozom haz\u0131r","Akrozomal reaksiyon: Zona pellucidaya ba\u011flanma \u2192 enzimler serbest","Polispermi \xf6nleme: H\u0131zl\u0131 blok (Na\u207a, depolarizasyon) + yava\u015f blok (kortikal reaksiyon)","Dizigotik: 2 yumurta + 2 sperm; monozigotik: 1 zigot ikiye b\xf6l\xfcn\xfcr","Sperm yap\u0131s\u0131: Akrozom (hidrolitik enzimler: akrozin, hyaluronidaz \u2192 zona pelluciday\u0131 deler) + Orta par\xe7a (mitokondri \u2192 enerji) + Kuyruk (9+2 mikrot\xfcb\xfcl, Kartagener \u2192 hareketsiz)","Zona pellucida proteinleri: ZP1, ZP2, ZP3; ZP3 sperm resept\xf6r\xfc; fertizin-antifertizin etkile\u015fimi; akrozomal reaksiyon sonras\u0131 ZP de\u011fi\u015fimi \u2192 polispermi engeli","Zigot olu\u015fumu: Sperm pronukleus + Oosit pronukleus \u2192 2n zigot; cinsiyet belirlenir (X veya Y); ilk b\xf6l\xfcnme ~30 saat sonra","Monozigotik ikizler tipleri: Birinci 3 g\xfcn \u2192 dikoryonik-diamyotik; 4-8. g\xfcn \u2192 monokoryonik-diamyotik; 8-13. g\xfcn \u2192 monokoryonik-monoamyotik; >13. g\xfcn \u2192 yap\u0131\u015f\u0131k ikiz","Infertilite nedenleri: Erkek (%40, azoospermi/oligospermi) + Kad\u0131n (%40, ov\xfclasyon bozuklu\u011fu/t\xfcp t\u0131kan\u0131kl\u0131\u011f\u0131) + A\xe7\u0131klanamayan (%20); IVF, ICSI ba\u015fl\u0131ca yard\u0131mc\u0131 \xfcreme teknikleri"],t.s)
