B.a5U=s(["Plevral ef\xfczyon: Trans\xfcda (KY, nefrotik) vs eks\xfcda (Light kriterleri: protein>0.5, LDH>0.6 oran)","Pn\xf6motoraks: Spontan (ince gen\xe7 erkek, b\xfcl r\xfcpt\xfcr\xfc) vs travmatik; tansiyon \u2192 trakea deviasyonu \u2192 acil i\u011fne dekompresyon","Pulmoner emboli: DVT \u2192 PA; ta\u015fikardi + pl\xf6ritik a\u011fr\u0131 + nefes darl\u0131\u011f\u0131; Well skoru \u2192 BT anjio; antikoag\xfclasyon","Masif PE: Hipotansiyon + sa\u011f kalp y\xfck\xfc \u2192 tromboliz veya embolektomi; S1Q3T3 EKG paterni","Pulmoner hipertansiyon: mPAP >20 mmHg; dispne + senkop + sa\u011f kalp yetmezli\u011fi; sildenafil/bosentan","Perikardit: Pl\xf6ritik a\u011fr\u0131 (\xf6ne e\u011filince azal\u0131r); perikardiyal frotman; saddle-back ST elevasyonu; NSA\u0130\u0130 + kol\u015fisin","Light kriterleri (eks\xfcda): Plevral protein/serum protein >0.5 VEYA Plevral LDH/serum LDH >0.6 VEYA Plevral LDH >2/3 ULN serum LDH; hepsine bak\u0131l\u0131r, birini kar\u015f\u0131larsa eks\xfcda","Pn\xf6motoraks boyutu: <2 cm (k\xfc\xe7\xfck, izle/O\u2082) vs \u22652 cm (b\xfcy\xfck, t\xfcp torakostomi); tansiyon pn\xf6motoraks\u0131 \u2192 i\u011fne 2. interkostal midklavik\xfclar hatta acil, sonra t\xfcp; PEEP'li MV hastada risk \u2191","PE riski s\u0131n\u0131fland\u0131rmas\u0131: D\xfc\u015f\xfck \u2192 D-dimer ile d\u0131\u015fla; Orta/y\xfcksek \u2192 BT pulmoner anjiyografi; PESI skoru prognoz; stabil antikoag\xfcle (DOAC tercih); kardiyojenik \u015fok \u2192 tromboliz","PAH s\u0131n\u0131flamas\u0131: Grup 1 (idiyopatik/kal\u0131tsal/CTD/HIV) Grup 2 (sol kalp) Grup 3 (akci\u011fer hastal\u0131\u011f\u0131/hipoksi) Grup 4 (kronik tromboembolik) Grup 5 (di\u011fer); grup 1 hedefli tedavi: prostasiklinler + ERA + PDE5i","Mezotelyoma: Plevra/periton malign t\xfcm\xf6r\xfc; asbestoz maruziyet; 30-40 y\u0131l latent; plevral ef\xfczyon + a\u011fr\u0131; CT/PET + plevral biyopsi; kalretinin (+) CD5/6 (-); prognoz k\xf6t\xfc; kemoterapi (pemetreksed+sisplatin)"],t.s)
