B.ZY=s(["AKI tan\u0131m\u0131: Kreatinin 48 saat i\xe7inde \u22650.3 mg/dL art\u0131\u015f veya 7 g\xfcn i\xe7inde \u22651.5\xd7 bazal","Prerenal: Hipovolemi/d\xfc\u015f\xfck kalp debisi \u2192 BUN/Kreatinin >20; FENa <%1; s\u0131v\u0131 ile d\xfczelir","\u0130ntrarenal: ATN (iskemi/toksin); FENa >%2; idrar Na >20; gran\xfcler silendir","Postrenal: \xdcriner t\u0131kan\u0131kl\u0131k; her iki b\xf6brek veya tek b\xf6brekse; ultrason \u2192 hidronefroz","ATN nedenleri: \u0130skemi (sepsis, \u015fok), kontras nefropati, aminoglikozitler, miyoglobin\xfcri (rabdomiyoliz)","ATN y\xf6netimi: Predispozan neden gider; s\u0131v\u0131 dengesi; hiperkalemi kontrol\xfc; diyaliz endikasyonu (AEIOU)","AEIOU diyaliz endikasyonu: Asidoz, Elektrolit (hiperK), \u0130ntokasiyon, S\u0131v\u0131 y\xfck\xfc (Overload), \xdcremik semptom"],t.s)
