B.a0P=s(["KBH tan\u0131m\u0131: GFR <60 veya b\xf6brek hasar\u0131 kan\u0131t\u0131 \u22653 ay; KDIGO evreleme G1-G5","En s\u0131k nedenler: DM nefropatisi (#1), hipertansif nefropati (#2), kronik GN","G3a: GFR 45-59; G3b: 30-44; G4: 15-29; G5 (<15) = b\xf6brek yetmezli\u011fi \u2192 RRT","KBH komplikasyonlar\u0131: Anemi (EPO \u2193), renal osteodistrofi (PTH \u2191, Ca \u2193, P \u2191), kardiyovask\xfcler risk \u2191\u2191","Tedavi: RAAS blokaj\u0131 (ACEi/ARB); kan bas\u0131nc\u0131 <130/80; DM kontrol\xfc; fosfat k\u0131s\u0131tlama","Renal osteodistrofi: Osteitis fibrosa (PTH \u2191) + osteomalazi; kalsiyum + D vitamini + fosfat ba\u011flay\u0131c\u0131","Hemodiyaliz: Diff\xfczyon prensipleri; AV fist\xfcl tercih; haftada 3\xd74 saat tipik; antikoag\xfclasyon"],t.s)
