B.a_p=s(["Nefritik sendrom: Hemat\xfcri (eritrosit silendir!) + protein\xfcri <3.5 g/g\xfcn + HT + AKI","Nefrotik sendrom: Protein\xfcri >3.5 g/g\xfcn + hipoalb\xfcminemi + \xf6dem + hiperlipidemi + lipid\xfcri","IgA nefropatisi (Berger): Sin\xfczit/tonsillit sonras\u0131 gross hemat\xfcri; en s\u0131k primer GN; IgA mezangiyumda",'Minimal de\u011fi\u015fiklik hastal\u0131\u011f\u0131: \xc7ocukta nefrotik #1; "foot process" f\xfczyonu EM\'de; steroid yan\u0131t\u0131 m\xfckemmel',"Fokal segmental glomer\xfcloskleroz: Eri\u015fkin nefrotik; HIV/heroin ili\u015fkili; steroid direnci s\u0131k","Membran\xf6z GN: Orta ya\u015f eri\u015fkin nefrotik; PLA2R antikoru; hepatit B / paraneoplastik","Anti-GBM (Goodpasture): Hemoptizi + hemat\xfcri; lineer IgG b\xf6brek BM'de; plazmaferez + imm\xfcns\xfcpresyon"],t.s)
