B.a8P=s(["Kalsiyum oksalat: En s\u0131k (%80); radyoopak; idrar Ca \u2191 (hiperparatiroidizm), oksalat \u2191 (Crohn)","\xdcrik asit ta\u015f\u0131: Gut; radyol\xfcsen; asidik idrar; alkalizasyon tedavi (bikarbonat)","Str\xfcvit ta\u015f\u0131: \xdcreaz (+) bakteri (Proteus, Klebsiella); alkalin idrar; geyik boynuzu ta\u015f\u0131","Sistin ta\u015f\u0131: Sistin\xfcri (otozomal resesif); heksagonal kristal; alkalizasyon + D-penisilamin","Ta\u015f tedavi: <5 mm spontan ge\xe7er; 5-10 mm ESWL; >10 mm PCNL veya URS","Renal t\xfcb\xfcler asidoz Tip 1 (distal): H\u207a at\u0131l\u0131m bozuk; idrar pH>5.5; hipokalemi; nefrolitiyazis","Fankoni sendromu: Proksimal t\xfcb\xfcl disfonksiyonu; glikoz\xfcri + fosfat\xfcri + aminoasid\xfcri; Wilson, miyelom"],t.s)
