B.a0i=s(["Siroz: \u0130rreversbl fibrozis; Child-Pugh A/B/C ve MELD skoru transplant karar\u0131","Portal hipertansiyon: Asit + \xf6zofageal varis + splenomegali + kaput medusa","Varis kanamas\u0131: IV oktreotid + endoskopik band ligasyonu; profilaksi \u2192 propranolol + bant","Asit tedavi: Tuz k\u0131s\u0131tla + spironolakton; diren\xe7li \u2192 furosemid ekle; refrakter \u2192 TIPS","Spontan bakteriyel peritonit: PMN >250/mm\xb3; E. coli s\u0131k; seftriakson; albumin koru","Hepatik ensefalopati: NH\u2083 birikimi; asteriksis; laktuloz + rifaksimin; protein k\u0131s\u0131tlama tart\u0131\u015fmal\u0131","Hepatorenal sendrom: Siroz + AKI; FENa <%1; prerenal de\u011fil; midodrin + oktreotid; transplant"],t.s)
B.aii=new A.D("Siroz & Komplikasyonlar\u0131",B.a0i)
B.a2Y=s(["Akut pankreatit: Safra ta\u015f\u0131 (#1) + alkol (#2); amilaz+lipaz \u2191>3\xd7; Ranson/APACHE II \u015fiddet","Kronik pankreatit: Alkol ++ ; egzokrin yetmezlik (steator\xe9) + endokrin (DM); kalsifikasyon BT'de","Pankreatit komplikasyon: Ps\xf6dokist (4 haftada olu\u015fur) \u2192 endoskopik drenaj; nekroz \u2192 enfekte \u2192 debridman","Pankreas kanseri: Ba\u015f b\xf6lgesi (a\u011fr\u0131s\u0131z sar\u0131l\u0131k + Courvoisier belirtisi); CA 19-9; \xe7ok k\xf6t\xfc prognoz; Whipple","Kolelitiyazis: Kolesterol ta\u015f\u0131 (Bat\u0131) + pigment ta\u015f\u0131 (hemolitik anemi); laparoskopik kolesistektomi","Kolanjit (Charcot \xfc\xe7l\xfcs\xfc): Ate\u015f + sar\u0131l\u0131k + sa\u011f \xfcst kadran a\u011fr\u0131s\u0131; ERCP + antibiyotik",'PSC: \u0130BH ili\u015fkili (\xdcK>Crohn); safra yollar\u0131nda fibrotik darl\u0131klar; "boncuk zinciri" ERCP/MRCP; siroz + kolanjiokarsinoma riski'],t.s)
