B.a91=s(["Sj\xf6gren sendromu: Kserostomi + kseroftalmia (kuruluk); anti-Ro/SSA + anti-La/SSB; sekonder (RA/SLE ile)","Sistemik skleroz (skleroderm): Deri kal\u0131nla\u015fmas\u0131 + Raynaud + i\xe7 organ fibrozis; ANA anti-Scl-70/antisentrome","CREST sendromu: Kalsifikasyon + Raynaud + \xd6zofagus disfonksiyonu + Sklerodaktili + Telenjiektazi; s\u0131n\u0131rl\u0131 form","Polimiyozit/Dermatomiyozit: Proksimal kas g\xfc\xe7s\xfczl\xfc\u011f\xfc + CK \u2191 + EMG bozuk; DM \u2192 heliotrope d\xf6k\xfcnt\xfc + Gottron pap\xfclleri","Polimiyalji romatika: >50 ya\u015f; omuz + kal\xe7a ku\u015fa\u011f\u0131 a\u011fr\u0131 + tutuklu\u011fu; CRP/ESR \u2191\u2191; d\xfc\u015f\xfck doz steroid dramatik","Dev h\xfccreli arterit: >50 ya\u015f; temporal arterde gran\xfclom; ba\u015f a\u011fr\u0131s\u0131 + \xe7ene klodikasyonu + g\xf6rme kayb\u0131 riski; steroid hemen!","Fibromiyalji: Yayg\u0131n a\u011fr\u0131 + yorgunluk + uyku bozuklu\u011fu; organik bulgu yok; egzersiz + amitriptilin + duloksetin"],t.s)
