B.a0r=s(["Do\u011fum: Ortalama 3.4 kg; ilk hafta %10 kilo kayb\u0131 normal; do\u011fum kilosuna 2. haftada d\xf6ner","Boy b\xfcy\xfcmesi: 1. y\u0131l +25 cm; 2. y\u0131l +12 cm; prepubertal +5-6 cm/y\u0131l; b\xfcy\xfcme h\u0131z pubertal at\u0131l\u0131mda \u2191","Kilo: 5-6 ayda 2 kat\u0131; 1 ya\u015fta 3 kat\u0131; 2 ya\u015fta 4 kat\u0131; pubertede art\u0131\u015f","Motor geli\u015fim: Ba\u015f tutma (3 ay) \u2192 oturma (6 ay) \u2192 desteksiz oturma (9 ay) \u2192 y\xfcr\xfcme (12-15 ay)","Dil: \u0130lk kelime (12 ay) \u2192 2 kelime birle\u015ftirme (24 ay) \u2192 c\xfcmle (36 ay); 2 ya\u015fta 50+ kelime bekle","Fontanel: \xd6n fontanel 12-18 ayda kapan\u0131r (24 aya kadar normal); kapal\u0131ysa kraniyosinostoz; geni\u015f + gergin \u2192 artm\u0131\u015f ICP","Tanner evrelemesi: K\u0131z puberte 8-13 ya\u015f ba\u015flar (telar\u015f); erkek 9-14 ya\u015f (testis b\xfcy\xfcmesi)"],t.s)
