B.a6D=s(["Naegele kural\u0131: Son adet + 9 ay 7 g\xfcn = tahmini do\u011fum tarihi; ortalama 280 g\xfcn/40 hafta","Gebelik trimesterleri: 1. (1-13. hafta) + 2. (14-26. hafta) + 3. (27-40. hafta)","\u0130lk trimester tarama: NT ultrason (11-13 hafta) + dual/triple test; NIPT (serbest fetal DNA)","AFP y\xfcksek: N\xf6ral t\xfcp defekti, kar\u0131n duvar\u0131 defekti, \xe7o\u011ful gebelik","AFP d\xfc\u015f\xfck: Down sendromu; estriol \u2193 + hCG \u2191 + AFP \u2193 = triple testte Down paterni","Antenatal a\u015f\u0131lar: Tetanoz-difteri (28-32 hafta), influenza; rubella kontrendike (canl\u0131)","GDM taramas\u0131: 24-28. haftada 50 g GCT; pozitifse 100 g OGTT; metformin veya ins\xfclin; b\xfcy\xfck bebek riski"],t.s)
