B.ZX=s(["Preeklampsi: \u226520. haftada HT (\u2265140/90) + protein\xfcri >300 mg/g\xfcn; MgSO\u2084 n\xf6bet profilaksi; do\u011fum tedavi","Eklampsi: Preeklampsiye ek olarak konv\xfclsiyon; MgSO\u2084 IV acil; kesin tedavi: do\u011fum","HELLP sendromu: Hemoliz + Karaci\u011fer enzim \u2191 + Trombosit \u2193; a\u011f\u0131r preeklampsi varyant\u0131","Gestasyonel diyabet: GDM; makrozomi + hipoglisemi (neonatal) + omuz distosisi riski","Plasenta previa: Plasenta servikal osu kapl\u0131yor; a\u011fr\u0131s\u0131z k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131 kanama; sezaryen","Plasenta dekolman\u0131 (abruptio): Plasenta erken ayr\u0131lmas\u0131; a\u011fr\u0131l\u0131 kanama + uterin rijidite; acil","Ektopik gebelik: Tuba uterina (%95); amenore + tek tarafl\u0131 a\u011fr\u0131 + hCG \u2191; transvajinal USG; MTX veya cerrahi"],t.s)
