B.a1V=s(['Endometriozis: Endometrium d\u0131\u015f\u0131nda endometrial doku; dismenore + disparoni + infertilite; "\xe7ikolata kist"',"PKOS (polikistik over sendromu): Oligomenore + hiperandrojenizm + polikistik over; LH/FSH \u2191; metformin","Liyomiyom (myom): D\xfcz kas t\xfcm\xf6r\xfc; en s\u0131k pelvik t\xfcm\xf6r; subm\xfck\xf6z \u2192 anormal kanama; miyomektomi/histerektomi","Servikal kanser: HPV 16,18; Pap smear tarama; CIN I-III \u2192 LEEP; invaziv \u2192 cerrahi+radyoterapi","Endometrium kanseri: Postmenopozal kanama; tip 1 (\xf6strojen ba\u011f\u0131ml\u0131) + tip 2; evreleme \u2192 histerektomi",'Over kanseri: "Sessiz katil"; ge\xe7 tan\u0131; CA-125; BRCA1/2 mutasyonu herediter risk; karboplatin+paklitaksel',"Vajinit: Bakteriyel vajinozis (amin kokusu + Clue h\xfccreleri + pH>4.5) vs Kandida (beyaz p\u0131ht\u0131 + ka\u015f\u0131nt\u0131) vs Trichomonas"],t.s)
