B.a8z=s(["Atopik dermatit (egzama): \xc7ocuklarda s\u0131k; ka\u015f\u0131nt\u0131 + likenifikasyon; antekubital + popliteal fossa; emolyan + TCS","Psoriazis: Kronik; g\xfcm\xfc\u015fi skuaml\u0131 eritemat\xf6z plaklar; diz + dirsek + skalp; Auspitz belirtisi (kanama)","Liken planus: 6P \u2014 Pruritic, Purple, Polygonal, Planar, Papules, Plaques; bilek fleks\xf6r y\xfcz\xfc; Wickham \xe7izgileri","Rozase: Y\xfcz orta b\xf6lge eritem + telenjektazi + pap\xfclop\xfcst\xfcl; UV + s\u0131cak + alkol tetikler; metronidazol jel","Seboreik dermatit: Sa\xe7l\u0131 deri + y\xfcz T zonu; ya\u011fl\u0131 sar\u0131 skuam; Malassezia; ketokonazol \u015fampuan","Kontakt dermatit: Alerjik (tip IV, 48-72 saat gecikme, nikel/lateks) vs irritan (deterjan, asit); patch test",'Pitiriazis rozea: Oval eritemli lekeler; "Noel a\u011fac\u0131" paterni s\u0131rtta; "herald patch" \xf6nce; kendili\u011finden ge\xe7er'],t.s)
