B.a4o=s(['D\u0131\u015f kulak yolu iltihab\u0131 (ODE): "Y\xfcz\xfcc\xfc kula\u011f\u0131"; Pseudomonas; a\u011fr\u0131 kulak \xe7ekiminde artar; asiditik kulak damlas\u0131',"Otitis media akut: S. pneumoniae + H. influenzae; \xe7ocuk; a\u011fr\u0131 + ate\u015f + kulak zar\u0131 bombeli; amoksisilin","Kronik otitis media: Kulak zar\u0131 perforasyonu; kolesteatom riski; deri epitelinin orta kula\u011fa invazyonu","Otoskleroz: Stapes fiksasyonu; iletim tipi i\u015fitme kayb\u0131; gen\xe7 yeti\u015fkin; stapedektomi","Sens\xf6rin\xf6ral i\u015fitme kayb\u0131 (SNHL): Sa\xe7 h\xfccresi hasar\u0131; g\xfcr\xfclt\xfc + ya\u015fl\u0131l\u0131k + ototoksik ila\xe7 (aminoglikozit, aspirin)","Meniere hastal\u0131\u011f\u0131: Endolenfatik hidrops; epizodik vertigo + fl\xfckt\xfcan i\u015fitme kayb\u0131 + tinnitus + kulak dolgunlu\u011fu","Benign paroksismal pozisyonel vertigo (BPPV): Otolit; ba\u015f\u0131n pozisyonuyla k\u0131sa vertigo; Dix-Hallpike + Epley manevras\u0131"],t.s)
