B.a_b=s(["Alerjik rinit: IgE arac\u0131l\u0131; intermitan veya persistant; burun ak\u0131nt\u0131s\u0131 + hap\u015f\u0131r\u0131k + ka\u015f\u0131nt\u0131; intranasal steroid + antihistamin",'Akut rinosin\xfczit: Viral (so\u011fuk alg\u0131nl\u0131\u011f\u0131); >10 g\xfcn veya "double sickening" \u2192 bakteriyel; amoksisilin-klavulanat',"Kronik rinosin\xfczit: >12 hafta; polipler s\u0131k; endoskopik sin\xfcs cerrahisi (FESS)","Nazal polip: Kronik inflamasyon; bilateral; eozinofil; NSAID duyarl\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131 (Samter triad\u0131: ast\u0131m+polip+NSAID)","Epistaksis: Anterior (Kiesselbach pleksusu, en s\u0131k) \u2192 burun s\u0131k\u0131\u015ft\u0131rma + g\xfcm\xfc\u015f nitrat; posterior (sphenopalatin) \u2192 tampon + cerrahi","Septum deviasyonu: Konjenital veya travmatik; t\u0131kan\u0131kl\u0131k; septoplasti",'Wegener gran\xfclomatozu (GPA): c-ANCA (+); \xfcst solunum + b\xf6brek + akci\u011fer; "saddle nose" deformitesi'],t.s)
