B.a8k=s(["BPH: Peri\xfcretral zona b\xfcy\xfcmesi; obstr\xfcktif (zay\u0131f idrar ak\u0131m\u0131, iki kez i\u015feme) + irritatif (s\u0131kl\u0131k, nokt\xfcri, urgensi)","BPH tedavi: Alfa bloker (tamsulosin \u2192 h\u0131zl\u0131 rahatlama) + 5-alfa red\xfcktaz inhibit\xf6r\xfc (finasterid \u2192 prostat\u0131 k\xfc\xe7\xfclt\xfcr)",'BPH cerrahi: TURP (trans\xfcretral rezeksiyon); "retrograd ejak\xfclasyon" en s\u0131k komplikasyon',"Prostat kanseri: Periferik zona; PSA tarama (tart\u0131\u015fmal\u0131); Gleason skoru; en s\u0131k kemik metastaz\u0131 (sklerotik)","Prostat Ca tedavi: Lokalize \u2192 radikal prostatektomi veya radyoterapi; metastatik \u2192 androjen deprivasyon (LHRH agonisti)","PSA: Benign de y\xfckseltir (BPH, prostatit); 4-10 ng/mL gri zon; serbest/total PSA oran\u0131 <15% \u2192 biyopsi","Prostatit: Akut bakteriyel (ate\u015f + perineal a\u011fr\u0131 + \xfcriner semptom) \u2192 florokinolon; kronik (rek\xfcrran \xdcSE) \u2192 uzun AB"],t.s)
