B.XR=s(["Mesane kanseri: Ge\xe7i\u015f h\xfccreli karsinom (TCC) %90; sigara #1 risk; boya+lastik sanayi; hemat\xfcri (a\u011fr\u0131s\u0131z)","Mesane Ca tan\u0131: Sistoskopi + biyopsi; y\xfczeysel (Ta-T1) \u2192 TURBT + intravezikal BCG; invaziv (T2+) \u2192 sistektomi","Renal h\xfccreli karsinom: Berrak h\xfccreli en s\u0131k; VHL mutasyonu; klasik triad (hemat\xfcri+flank a\u011fr\u0131+kitle) ge\xe7","RCC paraneoplastik: Polisitemi (EPO) + hiperkalsemi (PTHrP) + Stauffer sendromu (karaci\u011fer disfonksiyon)","RCC tedavi: Lokalize \u2192 nefrektomi; metastatik \u2192 sunitinib/pazopanib (TKI) veya nivolumab (imm\xfcn)","Wilms t\xfcm\xf6r\xfc (nefroblastom): \xc7ocuklarda en s\u0131k b\xf6brek t\xfcm\xf6r\xfc; kar\u0131n kitlesi; WAGR sendromu ili\u015fkili; kemoterapi + nefrektomi","B\xf6brek anjiyomiyolipom: TSC ili\u015fkili; ya\u011f i\xe7erir (BT'de tan\u0131); >4 cm \u2192 embolizasyon"],t.s)
