B.a0h=s(['Testis torsiyonu: Akut skrotal a\u011fr\u0131; "bell-clapper" deformitesi; Doppler USG; 6 saat i\xe7inde cerrahi \u2192 kurtar\u0131labilir',"Epididimit/Or\u015fit: <35 ya\u015f \u2192 klamidya/gonore; >35 ya\u015f \u2192 E. coli/Pseudomonas; a\u011fr\u0131 + \u015fi\u015flik; antibiyotik","Testis kanseri: Gen\xe7 erkek; a\u011fr\u0131s\u0131z sert kitle; kriptor\u015fidizmde risk \u2191; AFP (yolk sac) + \u03b2-hCG (koryokarsinom) + LDH","Seminoma: En s\u0131k testis Ca; radyosensitif; AFP y\xfckselmez; \u03b2-hCG hafif artabilir","Non-seminoma: AFP \u2191; RPLND (retroperitoneal lenf nodu diseksiyonu) + BEP kemoterapisi",'Varikosel: Sol testiste s\u0131k; "torba i\xe7inde solucan" his; infertilite nedeni; varikoselektomi',"Erkek infertilitesi: Semen analizi; oligozoospermi + astenozoospermi + teratozoospermi; FSH/LH/testosteron de\u011ferlendir"],t.s)
