B.a8C=s(["Stres inkontinans: Kar\u0131n i\xe7i bas\u0131n\xe7 art\u0131\u015f\u0131nda (\xf6ks\xfcr\xfck, hap\u015f\u0131r\u0131k); sfinkter yetersizli\u011fi; pelvik taban egz. + cerrahi",'Urge inkontinans: "A\u015f\u0131r\u0131 aktif mesane"; ani urgensi + idrar ka\xe7\u0131rma; oksibutinin/solifenasin (antimuskarinik)',"Mikst inkontinans: Stres + urge; her iki mekanizma","Ta\u015fma inkontinans\u0131: Kronik \xfcriner retansiyon; DM n\xf6ropatisi + BPH; s\xfcrekli damla damla ka\xe7\u0131rma; kateterizasyon","Gece idrara kalkma (nokt\xfcri): BPH + KKY + DM; s\u0131v\u0131 k\u0131s\u0131t + di\xfcretik sabaha al","Hemat\xfcri de\u011ferlendirme: A\u011fr\u0131s\u0131z \u2192 t\xfcm\xf6r; a\u011fr\u0131l\u0131 \u2192 ta\u015f/enfeksiyon; her a\u011fr\u0131s\u0131z hematuride sistoskopi","PSA tarama k\u0131lavuzu: 55-69 ya\u015f shared decision making; y\xfcksek risk (aile \xf6yk\xfcs\xfc, siyahi erkek) 40-54 ya\u015f"],t.s)
