B.a0W=s(["Randomize kontroll\xfc \xe7al\u0131\u015fma (RCT): Alt\u0131n standart; nedensellik kan\u0131tlar; randomizasyon se\xe7im yanl\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 \xf6nler","Kohort \xe7al\u0131\u015fmas\u0131: Maruziyetten sonucu izler; insidans + relatif risk hesaplan\u0131r; uzun s\xfcrer","Vaka-kontrol: Sonu\xe7tan geriye maruziyete; OR hesaplan\u0131r; nadir hastal\u0131klarda uygun; hat\u0131rlama yanl\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131","Kesitsel \xe7al\u0131\u015fma: Tek zaman noktas\u0131; prevalans hesaplan\u0131r; nedensellik kurulamaz","Ekolojik \xe7al\u0131\u015fma: Grup d\xfczeyinde; ekolojik yan\u0131lg\u0131 riski; h\u0131zl\u0131 ve ucuz","Meta-analiz: Birden fazla RCT birle\u015ftirilir; en y\xfcksek kan\u0131t d\xfczeyi; kan\u0131t piramidi tepesi","Kan\u0131t d\xfczeyi: Meta-analiz > RCT > Kohort > Vaka-kontrol > Kesitsel > Uzman g\xf6r\xfc\u015f\xfc"],t.s)
B.ahp=new A.D("\xc7al\u0131\u015fma Tasar\u0131mlar\u0131",B.a0W)
B.aaq=s(["\u0130nsidans: Belirli s\xfcrede yeni vaka / risk alt\u0131ndaki n\xfcfus; RCT ve kohortta hesaplan\u0131r","Prevalans: Belirli anda t\xfcm vaka / toplam n\xfcfus; kesitsel \xe7al\u0131\u015fmada hesaplan\u0131r","Relatif risk (RR): Maruziyet + / Maruziyet -; 1=etkisiz, >1=risk art\u0131\u015f\u0131, <1=koruyucu; kohortta","Odds oran\u0131 (OR): Vaka kontrolde; OR\u2248RR nadir hastal\u0131kta; vaka/(1-vaka) / kontrol/(1-kontrol)","Mutlak risk azalmas\u0131 (ARR): Kontrol riski \u2212 tedavi riski; NNT = 1/ARR","NNT (tedavi i\xe7in gerekli say\u0131): Bir sonucu \xf6nlemek i\xe7in tedavi edilmesi gereken hasta say\u0131s\u0131; d\xfc\u015f\xfckse iyi ila\xe7","Atfedilabilir risk: Maruziyet + riski \u2212 Maruziyet \u2212 riski; maruziyetin neden oldu\u011fu ek risk"],t.s)
B.agM=new A.D("\xd6l\xe7\xfctler & Hesaplamalar",B.aaq)
B.a6G=s(["Duyarl\u0131l\u0131k (sensitivite): TP/(TP+FN); hastal\u0131\u011f\u0131 olanlar\u0131 yakalama oran\u0131; y\xfcksekse yanl\u0131\u015f negatif az","\xd6zg\xfcll\xfck (spesifisite): TN/(TN+FP); hastal\u0131\u011f\u0131 olmayanlar\u0131 d\u0131\u015flama oran\u0131; y\xfcksekse yanl\u0131\u015f pozitif az","PPV (pozitif prediktif de\u011fer): TP/(TP+FP); pozitif test sonucu ger\xe7ekten hasta olma olas\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131; prevalansa ba\u011fl\u0131","NPV (negatif prediktif de\u011fer): TN/(TN+FN); negatif test sonucu ger\xe7ekten sa\u011fl\u0131kl\u0131 olma; prevalansa ba\u011fl\u0131","SNOUT: Y\xfcksek SeNsitiviteli test Negatif \u2192 hastal\u0131\u011f\u0131 d\u0131\u015fla (rule OUT)","SPIN: Y\xfcksek SPesifiteli test Pozitif \u2192 hastal\u0131\u011f\u0131 onayla (rule IN)","ROC e\u011frisi: Duyarl\u0131l\u0131k vs 1-\xf6zg\xfcll\xfck; AUC 0.5=\u015fans, 1.0=m\xfckemmel test; e\u015fik de\u011fer optimizasyonu"],t.s)
B.ahR=new A.D("Tan\u0131 Testi Performans\u0131",B.a6G)
B.Y1=s(["Se\xe7im yanl\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131: \xd6rneklem pop\xfclasyonu temsil etmez; randomizasyon \xf6nler","Bilgi yanl\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131: Hatal\u0131 \xf6l\xe7\xfcm; k\xf6r \xe7al\u0131\u015fma \xf6nler; hat\u0131rlama yanl\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131 vaka-kontrolde s\u0131k","Kar\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131c\u0131 de\u011fi\u015fken (confounding): Hem maruziyet hem sonu\xe7la ili\u015fkili 3. de\u011fi\u015fken; randomizasyon + stratifikasyon \xf6nler","Tip I hata (\u03b1): Yanl\u0131\u015f pozitif; yokken fark var diyoruz; p<0.05 e\u015fi\u011fi; \u03b1=0.05 ile %5 hata pay\u0131","Tip II hata (\u03b2): Yanl\u0131\u015f negatif; varken fark g\xf6remedik; g\xfc\xe7 = 1-\u03b2; g\xfc\xe7 %80 genellikle kabul","p de\u011feri: H\u2080 do\u011fruyken bu kadar a\u015f\u0131r\u0131 sonu\xe7 elde etme olas\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131; <0.05 anlaml\u0131 (istatistiksel)","G\xfcven aral\u0131\u011f\u0131 %95: 100 tekrarda 95'inde ger\xe7ek de\u011feri kapsar; CI 1'i i\xe7ermiyorsa RR/OR anlaml\u0131"],t.s)
B.afY=new A.D("Yanl\u0131l\u0131k & \u0130statistik",B.Y1)
B.a_F=s(["Tarama kriterleri (Wilson-Jungner): \xd6nemli sa\u011fl\u0131k sorunu + kabul edilebilir test + etkili tedavi + erken tan\u0131 fayda sa\u011flar","Lider s\xfcresi yanl\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131: Erken tan\u0131 hayatta kalma s\xfcresini uzatm\u0131\u015f gibi g\xf6sterir; hastal\u0131k seyri de\u011fi\u015fmez","Uzunluk yanl\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131: Tarama yava\u015f seyirli hastal\u0131klar\u0131 se\xe7er; agressif olanlar arada yakalan\u0131r","Koruyucu \xf6nlemler: Primer (hastal\u0131k \xf6ncesi; a\u015f\u0131, sa\u011fl\u0131kl\u0131 ya\u015fam) \u2192 Sekonder (erken tan\u0131; tarama) \u2192 Tersiyer (sakatl\u0131k \xf6nleme; rehabilitasyon)","Herd imm\xfcnitesi: Toplu a\u015f\u0131lama \u2192 hassas bireyi de korur; e\u015fik %70-95 (hastal\u0131\u011fa g\xf6re)","H\u0131zl\u0131k (attack rate): Maruziyet sonras\u0131 hastalananlar\u0131n oran\u0131; salg\u0131n ara\u015ft\u0131rmas\u0131nda kullan\u0131l\u0131r","Standart mortalite oran\u0131 (SMR): G\xf6zlenen/beklenen \xf6l\xfcm; >1 fazla \xf6l\xfcm; <1 koruyucu"],t.s)
