B.a6h=s(["G\xf6z katmanlar\u0131: Sklera (fibr\xf6z) \u2192 Koroid (damarsal) \u2192 Retina (n\xf6ral)","\xd6n segment: Kornea + \xf6n kamara (ak\xf6z h\xfcm\xf6r) + iris + lens","Arka segment: Arka kamara + vitreus + retina + optik disk + makula","Ak\xf6z h\xfcm\xf6r: Siliyer cisim \xfcretir \u2192 \xf6n kamaradan Schlemm kanal\u0131na drene \u2192 IOP belirler","Retina fotoresept\xf6rleri: Koni (merkezi g\xf6rme, renk, g\xfcnd\xfcz) + \xc7ubuk (periferal, gece, siyah-beyaz)","Makula lutea: En keskin g\xf6rme; fovea sentral en yo\u011fun koni b\xf6lgesi; sar\u0131 pigment UV'den korur","Optik sinir: CN II; blind spot (optik disk); \xe7apraz (kiazma): temporal lif ipsilateral, nasal lif kontralateral"],t.s)
