B.a1q=s(["Miyopi (k\u0131sa g\xf6r\xfcrl\xfck): G\xf6r\xfcnt\xfc retinan\u0131n \xf6n\xfcnde; uzak g\xf6rme bozuk; konkav (\u0131raksayan) lens","Hipermetropi (uzak g\xf6r\xfcrl\xfck): G\xf6r\xfcnt\xfc retinan\u0131n arkas\u0131nda; yak\u0131n g\xf6rme bozuk; konveks (yak\u0131nsayan) lens","Astigmatizm: Kornea d\xfczensizli\u011fi; her mesafede bulan\u0131k; silindirik lens","Presbiyopi: Ya\u015fla lens esnekli\u011fi azal\u0131r; yak\u0131n g\xf6rme bozulur; +40 ya\u015f; okuma g\xf6zl\xfc\u011f\xfc","Katarakt: Lens opakl\u0131\u011f\u0131; bulan\u0131k g\xf6rme + parlama + mono okular diplopi; cerrahi (fakoem\xfclsifikasyon + IOL)","Konjenital katarakt: Rubella + galaktozemi + Down + hipokalsemi; k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131 refleks muayene","Pseudoeksfoliyasyon: Lens kaps\xfcl\xfcnde materyal birikimi; glokom riski; Kafkas \u0131rk\u0131nda daha s\u0131k"],t.s)
B.ag3=new A.D("K\u0131rma Kusurlar\u0131 & Lens Hastal\u0131klar\u0131",B.a1q)
B.a49=s(["Glokom: IOP art\u0131\u015f\u0131 \u2192 optik sinir hasar\u0131 \u2192 g\xf6rme alan\u0131 kayb\u0131; a\xe7\u0131k a\xe7\u0131l\u0131 (kronik, sinsi) vs kapal\u0131 a\xe7\u0131l\u0131 (akut, a\u011fr\u0131l\u0131)","A\xe7\u0131k a\xe7\u0131l\u0131 glokom: En s\u0131k; IOP>21 mmHg; periferik g\xf6rme kayb\u0131 \xf6nce; timolol/latanoprost; laser trabek\xfcloplasti","Akut kapal\u0131 a\xe7\u0131 glokomu: Ani IOP art\u0131\u015f\u0131; a\u011fr\u0131 + bulant\u0131 + k\u0131zar\u0131k g\xf6z + kornea bulan\u0131kl\u0131\u011f\u0131; pilokarpin + asetazolamid + laser iridotomi acil","Diyabetik retinopati: Mikroanevrizma \u2192 eks\xfcda \u2192 neovask\xfclasyon; PDR (proliferatif) \u2192 vitreus kanamas\u0131; laser fotokoag\xfclasyon","Ya\u015fa ba\u011fl\u0131 makula dejenerasyonu (AMD): Kuru (druzen, atrofi) vs ya\u015f (neovask\xfclarizasyon; anti-VEGF ranibizumab)",'Retina dekolman\u0131: Arka vitreus ayr\u0131lmas\u0131 \u2192 retinal y\u0131rt\u0131k \u2192 s\u0131v\u0131 alt\u0131na girer; "ya\u011fmur + \u0131\u015f\u0131k \xe7akmas\u0131 + perde"; cerrahi acil',"Retina ven t\u0131kan\u0131kl\u0131\u011f\u0131: Santral (CRVO) veya dal (BRVO); makula \xf6demi + g\xf6rme kayb\u0131; anti-VEGF"],t.s)
B.afw=new A.D("Glokom & Retina Hastal\u0131klar\u0131",B.a49)
B.a4Q=s(["Konjonktivit: Viral (adenovir\xfcs; sulu ak\u0131nt\u0131) vs bakteriyel (S. aureus; p\xfcr\xfclan; topikal AB) vs alerjik (ka\u015f\u0131nt\u0131; antihistamin)","Klamidyal konjonktivit: Yenido\u011fanda (2-4. g\xfcn) + yeti\u015fkinde (kontrendike sekresyon); azitromisin","Keratit: Kornea iltihab\u0131; HSV (dendritik \xfclser; floresein) + bakteriyel + Acanthamoeba (kontak lens); topikal asiklovir","\xdcveit: \xd6n (iritis), orta, arka; HLA-B27 ili\u015fkili; otoimm\xfcn; steroid; a\u011fr\u0131 + fotofobi + k\u0131zarma","Papil\xf6dem: Artm\u0131\u015f ICP \u2192 optik disk \xf6demi; bilateral; pseudot\xfcm\xf6r serebri (obez gen\xe7 kad\u0131n) \u2192 LP bas\u0131n\xe7 \u2191","Strabismus (\u015fa\u015f\u0131l\u0131k): G\xf6z akslar\u0131n\u0131n paralel olmamas\u0131; esotropia (i\xe7) vs exotropia (d\u0131\u015f); ambliyopi \xf6nleme i\xe7in erken tedavi","Ambliyopi (tembel g\xf6z): G\xf6rsel korteks geli\u015fim bozuklu\u011fu; 0-7 ya\u015f kritik d\xf6nem; okl\xfczyon tedavisi (sa\u011flam g\xf6z kapatma)"],t.s)
