B.a7_=s(["Apandisit: Sa\u011f alt kadran a\u011fr\u0131; Alvarado/MANTRELS skoru; USG/BT; laparoskopik apendektomi","Peritonit: Diff\xfcz kar\u0131n a\u011fr\u0131s\u0131 + rijidite + rebound; acil laparotomi; geni\u015f spektrum antibiyotik","Ba\u011f\u0131rsak t\u0131kan\u0131kl\u0131\u011f\u0131: Mekanik (yap\u0131\u015f\u0131kl\u0131k #1) vs paralitik; hava-s\u0131v\u0131 seviyeleri X-ray; NG dekompresyon",'Mezenter iskemisi: "Ac\u0131yla orant\u0131s\u0131z" az bulgu; AF + ateroskleroz zemin; BT anjio; acil revask\xfclarizasyon',"Kolorektal kanser: Sa\u011f taraf (demir eksikli\u011fi anemisi) vs sol taraf (obstr\xfcksiyon + kan); kolonoskopi; hemikolektomi","F\u0131t\u0131k: \u0130nguinal (erkekte s\u0131k) + femoral (kad\u0131nda) + umbulikal; inkarserasyon \u2192 strang\xfclasyon \u2192 acil","Hemoroid: \u0130\xe7 (a\u011fr\u0131s\u0131z kanama) vs d\u0131\u015f (a\u011fr\u0131l\u0131 trombozlu); konservatif \u2192 bant ligasyonu \u2192 cerrahi"],t.s)
