B.a1h=s(["Kanserin 6 \xf6zelli\u011fi (Hallmarks): B\xfcy\xfcme sinyali ba\u011f\u0131ms\u0131zl\u0131\u011f\u0131 + b\xfcy\xfcme bask\u0131c\u0131s\u0131na direni\u015f + apoptoz ka\xe7\u0131\u015f\u0131 + s\u0131n\u0131rs\u0131z \xe7o\u011falma + anjiogenez + metastaz","Onkogen: B\xfcy\xfcmeyi uyar\u0131r; gain-of-function mutasyon; tek allel yeter; RAS, MYC, HER2, BCR-ABL","T\xfcm\xf6r bask\u0131lay\u0131c\u0131 gen: B\xfcy\xfcmeyi bask\u0131lar; loss-of-function; iki allel kayb\u0131 (2-hit); TP53, RB, BRCA1/2, APC",'TP53: "Genomun gardiyan\u0131"; DNA hasar\u0131nda apoptoz/h\xfccre d\xf6ng\xfcs\xfc durur; en s\u0131k mutasyonlu t\xfcm\xf6r geni',"Telomeraz: T\xfcm\xf6r h\xfccrelerinde aktif; telomer k\u0131salmas\u0131n\u0131 \xf6nler \u2192 \xf6l\xfcms\xfczl\xfck","Epigenetik de\u011fi\u015fiklikler: DNA metilasyonu (gen susturma) + histon modifikasyonu; ila\xe7 hedefi (HDAC inhibit\xf6r)","T\xfcm\xf6r mikro-\xe7evresi: Ba\u011f\u0131\u015f\u0131kl\u0131k h\xfccreleri + fibroblastlar + damarlar; PD-L1 ekspresyonu imm\xfcnoterapi yan\u0131t\u0131n\u0131 etkiler"],t.s)
