B.a36=s(["Down sendromu (Trizomi 21): Hirschsprung + AV kanal + AVSD; hipotoni; ileri anne ya\u015f\u0131; Alzheimer riski \u2191","Edwards sendromu (Trizomi 18): Geri b\xfck\xfcml\xfc parmak + rocker-bottom ayak; genelde neonatal \xf6l\xfcm","Patau sendromu (Trizomi 13): Yar\u0131k dudak/damak + siklopi + polidaktili; fatal","Turner sendromu (45,X): Fenotip kad\u0131n; boy k\u0131sal\u0131\u011f\u0131 + primer amenore + koarktasyon + at nal\u0131 b\xf6brek; \xf6strojen replasman\u0131","Klinefelter (47,XXY): Fenotip erkek; uzun boy + k\xfc\xe7\xfck testis + jinekomasti + infertilite; testosteron replasman\u0131","Fragile X: FMR1 geni (CGG tekrar\u0131); otizm + entelekt\xfcel yetmezlik + macroor\u015fidizm; erkekte daha a\u011f\u0131r",'Prader-Willi vs Angelman: Chromosome 15; Prader-Willi (paternal silinme: hipotoni+obezite+hipogonadizm) vs Angelman (maternal silinme: "mutlu kukla")'],t.s)
