B.a22=s(["PCR: Polimeraz zincir reaksiyonu; DNA amplifikasyonu; enfeksiy\xf6z hastal\u0131k tan\u0131s\u0131 + kanser mutasyon tespiti","CRISPR-Cas9: Gen d\xfczenleme; genomik d\xfczeyde kesim; orak h\xfccre + beta-talasemi klinik \xe7al\u0131\u015fmalar\u0131","Gen tedavisi: Viral vekt\xf6r (AAV) veya lipid nanopartik\xfcl; SMA (onasemnogen), hemofili A/B (valoctocogene)","mRNA tedavisi: Protein \xfcretim talimat\u0131; COVID-19 a\u015f\u0131lar\u0131 + herediter transthyretin amiloidoz (patisiran)","RNA interferans\u0131 (siRNA): Spesifik mRNA susturma; inclisiran (PCSK9 \u2192 LDL \u2193); givosiran (akut hepatik porfiri)","Proteom & metabolom: Protein ve metabolit d\xfczeyinde analiz; biyobelirte\xe7 ke\u015ffi; ki\u015fiselle\u015ftirilmi\u015f t\u0131p","Farmakogenomik: Genetik varyant \u2192 ila\xe7 yan\u0131t\u0131; CYP2D6 (kodein \u2192 morfin d\xf6n\xfc\u015f\xfcm\xfc), TPMT (tiyop\xfcrin toksisitesi)"],t.s)
