B.aa1=s(["K\u0131r\u0131k tipleri: Transvers, oblik, spiral (torsiyon), kommin\xfct (par\xe7al\u0131), a\xe7\u0131k (deri b\xfct\xfcnl\xfc\u011f\xfc bozuk)","A\xe7\u0131k k\u0131r\u0131k s\u0131n\u0131flamas\u0131 (Gustilo): I (<1 cm yara) \u2192 II (1-10 cm) \u2192 III (>10 cm veya n\xf6rovask\xfcler yaralanma)","K\u0131r\u0131k tedavi prensipleri: Red\xfcksiyon + Tespir + Rehabilitasyon; al\xe7\u0131 veya cerrahi (ORIF/IM \xe7ivi)","Kompartman sendromu: Kas\u0131lmayan fasya i\xe7inde bas\u0131n\xe7 \u2191; 5P \u2014 Pain + Pressure + Paresthesia + Pallor + Pulselessness; acil fasiyotomi","Femur boyun k\u0131r\u0131\u011f\u0131: Ya\u015fl\u0131 kad\u0131n + osteoporoz; k\u0131sa-d\u0131\u015f rotasyonlu bacak; internal tespit (<65 ya\u015f) veya hemiartroplasti",'Colles k\u0131r\u0131\u011f\u0131: Distal radius; d\xfc\u015fmede el \xfcst\xfcne; "\xe7atal s\u0131rt\u0131" deformitesi; al\xe7\u0131 veya perk\xfctan tel',"Ya\u011f embolisi sendromu: Uzun kemik k\u0131r\u0131\u011f\u0131 sonras\u0131; hipoksi + pete\u015fi + konf\xfczyon; destek tedavi"],t.s)
