B.XF=s(["Lomber disk hernisi: L4-L5 + L5-S1 en s\u0131k; bacak a\u011fr\u0131s\u0131 (siyatik) > bel a\u011fr\u0131s\u0131; SLR testi; MR; konservatif \u2192 cerrahi","Servikal disk hernisi: Boyun + kol a\u011fr\u0131s\u0131 + parestezi; C5-C6 (biseps DTR), C6-C7 (triseps DTR)",'Spinal stenoz: Ya\u015fl\u0131; "n\xf6rojenik kladikasyon" \u2014 y\xfcr\xfcy\xfcnce bacak a\u011fr\u0131s\u0131 + e\u011filince ge\xe7er; dekompresyon cerrahisi',"Skolyoz: Lateral e\u011frilik; adolesanda idiyopatik (k\u0131z>erkek); Cobb a\xe7\u0131s\u0131 >10\xb0; 25-45\xb0 \u2192 korse; >45\xb0 \u2192 cerrahi","Spondilolizis & Spondilolisztez: Pars interartikularis defekti; jimnastik\xe7iler + ma\xe7o kald\u0131ranlarda; bel a\u011fr\u0131s\u0131; L5-S1","Sakrum/Koksiks k\u0131r\u0131\u011f\u0131: D\xfc\u015fme; oturma a\u011fr\u0131s\u0131; \xe7o\u011funlukla konservatif; simmfiz pubis ayr\u0131lmas\u0131 do\u011fumda"],t.s)
