B.a8Q=s(["Tendinopati: A\u015f\u0131r\u0131 kullan\u0131m; a\u015fil + patellar + lateral epikondilit (tenis dirse\u011fi) + medial epikondilit (golf dirse\u011fi)","Plantar fasiit: Topuk a\u011fr\u0131s\u0131; sabah ilk ad\u0131mda zirve; germe egzersizleri + topuk yast\u0131\u011f\u0131 + steroid enjeksiyonu","Stres k\u0131r\u0131\u011f\u0131: Tekrarlayan y\xfck; metatars + tibia + femur boynu; kemik sintigrafisi erken tan\u0131; istirahat","Concussion (sars\u0131nt\u0131): Kafa travmas\u0131; bilin\xe7 kayb\u0131 olmayabilir; ba\u015f a\u011fr\u0131s\u0131 + bulant\u0131 + \u0131\u015f\u0131k hassasiyeti; protokol ile kademeli d\xf6n\xfc\u015f","Kont\xfczyon: Kas i\xe7i kanama; kuadriseps + gastroknemius; RICE (Rest-Ice-Compression-Elevation); miyozit ossifikan riski","Burkulma (sprain): Ligaman yaralanmas\u0131; derece I (gerilme) \u2192 II (parsiyel y\u0131rt\u0131k) \u2192 III (tam y\u0131rt\u0131k); PRICE + rehabilitasyon","Rhabdomiyoliz: Yo\u011fun egzersiz + is\u0131 + statinler; CK \u2191\u2191\u2191 + miyoglobin\xfcri + AKI; IV s\u0131v\u0131 hidrasyon acil"],t.s)
