B.a6_=s(["Anyon a\xe7\u0131\u011f\u0131: Na - (Cl + HCO3); normal 8-12; y\xfcksek \u2192 MUDPILES (Methanol, Uremia, DKA, Paraldehyde, INH, Lactic, Ethylene, Salicylate)","Osmolalite a\xe7\u0131\u011f\u0131: \xd6l\xe7\xfclen - hesaplanan osmolalite; >10 \u2192 mannitol, etanol, metanol, etilengliko","\u0130drar analizi: Protein + glikoz + nitrit (bakteri) + l\xf6kosit esteraz + eritrosit; silendir tipi (gran\xfcler ATN; eritrosit GN)","Tiroit fonksiyon: TSH \xf6nce bak; TSH \u2191 \u2192 serbest T4 bak (hipotiroidi); TSH \u2193 \u2192 serbest T4 + T3 (hipertiroidi)","HbA1c: Son 3 ayl\u0131k ortalama glukoz; %6.5 DM tan\u0131; %7 hedef; hemoliz/hemoglobinopatide yan\u0131lt\u0131c\u0131","INR: PT temelli; warfarin izlemi; 2-3 (AF/DVT); 2.5-3.5 (mekanik kapak); >5 kanama riski belirgin","ESR & CRP: ESR yava\u015f y\xfckselir (g\xfcnler); CRP h\u0131zl\u0131 (saatler); her ikisi y\xfcksekse aktif inflamasyon/enfeksiyon; CRP tedavi yan\u0131t\u0131 izlemede daha yararl\u0131"],t.s)
